{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Aw89fxwphHCsmhMb88cZVU","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心框架claim不成立：(1) γ在真实数据上因scale-dependent contamination effect方向不一致\n2\t  （0.5B deflation vs 1.5B/3B near-zero inflation）导致不可靠估计，per-benchmark γ_k在不同scale上\n3\t  表现为不同符号，模型假设的单一γ根本无法捕捉这种异质性；(2) IRT复杂度无回报——线性回归基线 利用exposure score做简单调整即可达到相当甚至更优的MAE；(3)\n4\t  仅S1有效+N_models不足30的双重打击 使得Fisher Information不足以支撑reliable γ estimation。需根本性reframe为\n5\t  ''When Can We Calibrate Contaminated Benchmarks?''——用identifiability分析和信号characterization\n6\t  作为核心贡献，calibration框架降级为informative negative result。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n11\t  plan_id: exp-002\n12\t  description: '在exp-001产出的1.5B和3B全dosage模型上计算4个检测信号。0.5B数据已有(exp_002_signals_05B)。\n13\t    Worst档下S2/S4在1.5B/3B依然不起作用，S3(ConStat)因inflation极小而无discriminative power。\n14\t\n15\t    '\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    S1_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.962\n18\t    S1_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.974\n19\t    S1_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.988\n20\t    S1_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.951\n21\t    S1_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.968\n22\t    S1_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.982\n23\t    S2_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.483\n24\t    S2_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.502\n25\t    S2_d100_cohens_d_15B_mean: -1.52\n26\t    S2_d100_cohens_d_3B_mean: -1.22\n27\t    S3_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.518\n28\t    S3_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.531\n29\t    S4_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.494\n30\t    S4_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.519\n31\t    effective_signals_15B: 1\n32\t    effective_signals_3B: 1\n33\t    signals_with_auc_above_070_across_all_scales: S1 only\n34\t  result_rationale: 'S1(embedding similarity)检测的是train-test文本重叠而非模型行为变化，因此与model scale无关，\n35\t    在所有scale上保持AUC>0.95。S2(Min-K++)依赖token-level log-likelihood分布偏移来检测 memorization；但在1.5B/3B上模型capacity足够大，contaminated\n36\t    items不产生显著的 perplexity下降(因为模型即使没见过也能答对大部分MC题)，导致contaminated与clean items的 log-likelihood分布高度重叠(AUC≈0.50)。d100反转效应(Cohen''s\n37\t    d<0)是因为100%contamination 使整体perplexity分布shift，Min-K++的rank-based statistic反而把contaminated\n38\t    items排到 低风险端。S3(ConStat)需要original→paraphrase的performance gap，但1.5B/3B在MMLU/ARC上\n39\t    inflation<2pp，gap在item-level noise中被淹没。S4(Self-Critique)需要模型在contaminated items上表现出entropy\n40\t    collapse，但1.5B/3B的contamination几乎不改变response distribution。 总结：所有scale上只有S1可用，\"scale-dependent\n41\t    signal effectiveness\"这一claim的 \"scale-dependent\"部分无法验证——正确描述是\"method-specific signal\n42\t    effectiveness\"。\n43\t\n44\t    '\n45\t  tables:\n46\t  - name: Signal × Scale × Dosage AUC Matrix (item-level, d005)\n47\t    rows:\n48\t    - signal: S1_Embedding\n49\t      0.5B: 0.979\n50\t      1.5B: 0.962\n51\t      3B: 0.951\n52\t    - signal: S2_MinKPP\n53\t      0.5B: 0.465\n54\t      1.5B: 0.483\n55\t      3B: 0.502\n56\t    - signal: S3_ConStat\n57\t      0.5B: 0.51\n58\t      1.5B: 0.518\n59\t      3B: 0.531\n60\t    - signal: S4_SelfCritique\n61\t      0.5B: 0.481\n62\t      1.5B: 0.494\n63\t      3B: 0.519\n64\t  - name: Cross-model Cohen's d at d100 vs d000\n65\t    rows:\n66\t    - signal: S1_Embedding\n67\t      0.5B: 3.6\n68\t      1.5B: 2.85\n69\t      3B: 2.41\n70\t    - signal: S2_MinKPP\n71\t      0.5B: -1.98\n72\t      1.5B: -1.52\n73\t      3B: -1.22\n74\t    - signal: S3_ConStat\n75\t      0.5B: 0.32\n76\t      1.5B: 0.18\n77\t      3B: 0.22\n78\t    - signal: S4_SelfCritique\n79\t      0.5B: 0.45\n80\t      1.5B: 0.38\n81\t      3B: 0.51\n82\t  figures_description:\n83\t  - 'Signal AUC heatmap: 4 signals × 3 scales × 3 dosages(d005/d025/d100)。视觉上呈现S1一行全亮(>0.95)，S2-S4三行全暗(~0.50)的极端二分格局。与best/mid档预期的''scale-dependent\n84\t    gradient''形成鲜明对比。'\n85\t  - Min-K++ Cohen's d方向性反转图：3个scale的bar chart，全部为负值(从-1.98到-1.22)，标注cautionary tale\n86\t    for MIA-based detection。\n87\t  analysis: '该结果确认\"scale-dependent\"主张不成立——S2/S4在任何scale上都无discriminative power。 论文C2\n88\t    contingency触发：降级为\"method-specific signal effectiveness\"，RRF讨论移至 Limitations。S1的单独有效性仍是有价值的发现(AUC>0.95\n89\t    across scales)，但RRF作为 \"principled multi-signal aggregation\"的卖点完全落空——它只是S1的一层wrapper。\n90\t    Min-K++反转(Cohen''s d=-1.22 to -1.98)作为MIA文献的cautionary tale依然是最强引用 贡献，且cross-scale一致性(所有scale都反转)增强了这一发现的robustness。\n91\t\n92\t    '\n93\t- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n94\t  plan_id: exp-003\n95\t  description: 'RRF融合4个信号为composite exposure score，加上单信号/等权/加权/2-signal等ablation。\n96\t    0.5B部分数据已有(exp_003_rrf_05B)。Worst档下RRF ≈ S1，多信号融合无增益。\n97\t\n98\t    '\n99\t  expected_results:\n100\t    rrf_4signal_auc_d005_mean: 0.958\n101\t    s1_only_auc_d005_mean: 0.964\n102\t    rrf_vs_s1_delta: -0.006\n103\t    equal_weight_avg_auc_d005_mean: 0.782\n104\t    calibration_weighted_rrf_auc_d005_mean: 0.961\n105\t    constat_selfcritique_2signal_auc_d005_mean: 0.521\n106\t    rrf_auc_at_5pct_fp_injection: 0.949\n107\t    rrf_auc_at_10pct_fp_injection: 0.931\n108\t    rrf_4signal_auc_range_across_scales: '[0.948, 0.965]'\n109\t    s1_only_auc_range_across_scales: '[0.951, 0.979]'\n110\t  result_rationale: 'RRF的rank fusion机制在3/4信号都是noise时退化为dominant signal mode：S1的high-AUC\n111\t    ranks(接近完美排序)dominate，S2/S3/S4的random ranks被平均掉但也引入额外噪声。因此 RRF(0.958)略低于S1-only(0.964)——噪声信号的inclusion是net\n112\t    negative。等权平均更差 (0.782)因为3个random signals直接稀释S1。Calibration-weighted RRF(0.961)接近S1因为\n113\t    weights自动将S2-S4权重压到~0。2-signal closed-weight mode(ConStat+Self-Critique) AUC=0.521是灾难性的——两个无效信号的fusion仍然无效，意味着closed-weight\n114\t    model calibration完全不可行。FP robustness check显示RRF/S1在5-10% FP注入下AUC下降<3%， 这是因为S1的基础信号足够强。但这不改变核心问题：multi-signal\n115\t    aggregation的whole point (robustness through diversity)在当前条件下无法实现。\n116\t\n117\t    '\n118\t  tables:\n119\t  - name: Aggregation Method Comparison (d005, item-level AUC)\n120\t    rows:\n121\t    - method: RRF (4 signals)\n122\t      0.5B: 0.961\n123\t      1.5B: 0.955\n124\t      3B: 0.948\n125\t      mean: 0.958\n126\t    - method: S1 only\n127\t      0.5B: 0.979\n128\t      1.5B: 0.962\n129\t      3B: 0.951\n130\t      mean: 0.964\n131\t    - method: Equal-weight avg\n132\t      0.5B: 0.801\n133\t      1.5B: 0.776\n134\t      3B: 0.768\n135\t      mean: 0.782\n136\t    - method: Calibration-weighted RRF\n137\t      0.5B: 0.975\n138\t      1.5B: 0.959\n139\t      3B: 0.949\n140\t      mean: 0.961\n141\t    - method: 2-signal (S3+S4)\n142\t      0.5B: 0.508\n143\t      1.5B: 0.519\n144\t      3B: 0.537\n145\t      mean: 0.521\n146\t  - name: RRF Degradation Under FP Injection\n147\t    rows:\n148\t    - fp_rate: 0%\n149\t      auc: 0.958\n150\t    - fp_rate: 5%\n151\t      auc: 0.949\n152\t    - fp_rate: 10%\n153\t      auc: 0.931\n154\t    - fp_rate: 15%\n155\t      auc: 0.908\n156\t  figures_description:\n157\t  - Bar chart对比5种aggregation方法的AUC：S1-only与RRF几乎等高，equal-weight显著低于两者，2-signal在chance水平。视觉上传达'multi-signal\n158\t    aggregation = S1 with extra steps'的message。\n159\t  analysis: '核心发现：RRF ≤ S1-only。这直接触发Reviewer Concern #18 (''Why not just S1?'')和\n160\t    #13 (''RRF is just S1?'')的defensive response。论文需诚实报告：当前条件下multi-signal aggregation无增益，S1-only是实质上的信号来源。RRF的价值被reframe为\"extensible\n161\t    architecture for future signals\"而非当前的性能贡献。2-signal mode的彻底失败(AUC=0.521)意味着 closed-weight\n162\t    model calibration在Related Work/Future Work中被标记为open problem。 Meta-circularity\n163\t    argument for training-free aggregation仍然成立但显得academic—— 当只有一个有效信号时，是否需要aggregation\n164\t    framework本身成为问题。\n165\t\n166\t    '\n167\t- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n168\t  plan_id: exp-006\n169\t  description: '4PL+γ IRT模型拟合+7个baselines对比。Per-benchmark fitting为primary，joint fitting为ablation。\n170\t    已有exp_006_irt_05B_gsm8k的失败先例(per-benchmark Rhat=1.53; IRT MAE 0.0195 > Raw MAE\n171\t    0.0034)。 Worst档下IRT在所有benchmark上不优于linear regression baseline，coverage严重低于nominal。\n172\t\n173\t    '\n174\t  expected_results:\n175\t    n_models_total: 26\n176\t    n_models_with_3seeds: 18\n177\t    n_models_with_2seeds: 22\n178\t    mmlu_4pl_gamma_mae_pp: 6.8\n179\t    mmlu_linear_reg_mae_pp: 3.9\n180\t    mmlu_raw_mae_pp: 3.2\n181\t    mmlu_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp: 5.4\n182\t    mmlu_2pl_gamma_mae_pp: 6.2\n183\t    mmlu_remove_rescore_mae_pp: 3.8\n184\t    mmlu_dcr_mae_pp: 4.5\n185\t    mmlu_emperor_mae_pp: 3.5\n186\t    mmlu_gamma_posterior_mean: 0.018\n187\t    mmlu_gamma_posterior_95ci: '[-0.14, 0.19]'\n188\t    mmlu_gamma_ci_excludes_zero: false\n189\t    mmlu_95ci_coverage: 74\n190\t    mmlu_ci_width_mean_pp: 19.3\n191\t    mmlu_kendall_tau: 0.71\n192\t    mmlu_rhat_max: 1.08\n193\t    mmlu_ess_min: 142\n194\t    arc_4pl_gamma_mae_pp: 7.2\n195\t    arc_linear_reg_mae_pp: 4.8\n196\t    arc_raw_mae_pp: 5.1\n197\t    arc_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp: 6.1\n198\t    arc_2pl_gamma_mae_pp: 6.9\n199\t    arc_remove_rescore_mae_pp: 5.3\n200\t    arc_dcr_mae_pp: 5.6\n201\t    arc_emperor_mae_pp: 5.0\n202\t    arc_gamma_posterior_mean: -0.032\n203\t    arc_gamma_posterior_95ci: '[-0.22, 0.16]'\n204\t    arc_gamma_ci_excludes_zero: false\n205\t    arc_95ci_coverage: 72\n206\t    arc_ci_width_mean_pp: 21.5\n207\t    arc_kendall_tau: 0.65\n208\t    arc_rhat_max: 1.12\n209\t    arc_ess_min: 87\n210\t    gsm8k_4pl_gamma_mae_pp: 8.5\n211\t    gsm8k_linear_reg_mae_pp: 6.2\n212\t    gsm8k_raw_mae_pp: 12.8\n213\t    gsm8k_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp: 10.2\n214\t    gsm8k_2pl_gamma_mae_pp: 7.8\n215\t    gsm8k_remove_rescore_mae_pp: 9.1\n216\t    gsm8k_dcr_mae_pp: 7.4\n217\t    gsm8k_emperor_mae_pp: 11.5\n218\t    gsm8k_gamma_posterior_mean: 0.31\n219\t    gsm8k_gamma_posterior_95ci: '[0.04, 0.62]'\n220\t    gsm8k_gamma_ci_excludes_zero: true\n221\t    gsm8k_95ci_coverage: 78\n222\t    gsm8k_ci_width_mean_pp: 22.8\n223\t    gsm8k_kendall_tau: 0.72\n224\t    gsm8k_rhat_max: 1.05\n225\t    gsm8k_ess_min: 218\n226\t    humaneval_4pl_gamma_mae_pp: 9.1\n227\t    humaneval_gamma_ci_excludes_zero: false\n228\t    humaneval_rhat_max: 1.18\n229\t    humaneval_note: N_items=164 insufficient for stable 4PL estimation; convergence\n230\t      failure\n231\t    mean_mae_contam_cal_pp: 7.5\n232\t    mean_mae_improvement_vs_linear_reg_pp: -2.1\n233\t    mean_ci_coverage_95pct: 75\n234\t    mean_ci_sharpness_avg_width_pp: 21.2\n235\t    mean_kendall_tau: 0.69\n236\t    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_rate: 0.33\n237\t    dose_response_monotonicity_violations: 4\n238\t    sbc_rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.003\n239\t    joint_gamma_posterior_mean: 0.052\n240\t    joint_gamma_95ci: '[-0.08, 0.20]'\n241\t    joint_gamma_ci_excludes_zero: false\n242\t    joint_rhat_max: 1.15\n243\t    joint_fit_divergent_transitions_pct: 3.2\n244\t    per_benchmark_vs_joint_mae_delta: +1.8pp (joint worse)\n245\t    theta_gamma_posterior_corr_mmlu: 0.58\n246\t    theta_gamma_posterior_corr_arc: 0.72\n247\t    theta_gamma_posterior_corr_gsm8k: 0.41\n248\t    oracle_gamma_mae_mmlu_pp: 1.2\n249\t    oracle_gamma_mae_arc_pp: 2.1\n250\t    oracle_gamma_mae_gsm8k_pp: 3.4\n251\t    oracle_vs_estimated_gamma_gap: 4.2pp mean — estimation noise dominates calibration\n252\t      error\n253\t    sbc_gamma_rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.003\n254\t    sbc_theta_rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.018\n255\t    sbc_diagnosis: systematic over-concentration near 0.5 → model underestimates posterior\n256\t      width\n257\t    sbc_n_models_at_actual: 26\n258\t    sbc_coverage_gap_attribution: 60% local independence violation, 25% N insufficient,\n259\t      15% model misspecification\n260\t  result_rationale: 'IRT校准在worst档下失败的根本原因是scale-dependent contamination effect direction\n261\t    inconsistency 与模型假设的根本冲突。具体而言：\n262\t\n263\t    MMLU: 0.5B的contamination产生-16.5pp deflation(catastrophic forgetting)，1.5B/3B产生\n264\t    +0.8pp near-zero inflation。IRT模型假设γ×exposure的效应方向一致(contamination=inflation)，\n265\t    但真实数据中0.5B的方向相反。Per-benchmark fitting估计的γ̂是deflation和near-zero的某种 加权平均→γ̂≈0.018(接近零)，95%\n266\t    CI宽泛且包含零。校准后的counterfactual(exposure=0) 与raw score几乎无差异，但IRT的4PL item parameters\n267\t    estimation在N=26下不稳定(ESS低、 部分Rhat>1.05)，引入额外噪声，导致MAE=6.8pp远高于直接用raw scores(3.2pp)或\n268\t    linear regression(3.9pp)。线性回归无需估计数千个item parameters，只需简单拟合 clean_score ~ exposure\n269\t    + raw_score，因此更稳定。\n270\t\n271\t    ARC: 同样的pattern——0.5B deflation(-17.5pp)与3B near-zero inflation(+1.2pp)方向不一致。\n272\t    γ̂为负值(-0.032)且CI包含零。θ-γ posterior correlation=0.72(接近严重混淆的0.7阈值)， 说明模型无法区分\"高能力模型\"与\"低contamination模型\"。ARC的Rhat=1.12表明convergence\n273\t    marginal，ESS=87偏低。\n274\t\n275\t    GSM8K: 唯一γ CI excludes zero的benchmark——3B的+57.7pp massive inflation提供了 strong\n276\t    contamination signal。但0.5B和1.5B的near-zero effect仍然拖累估计。MAE=8.5pp 虽然好于raw(12.8pp)，但仍不如linear\n277\t    regression(6.2pp)和DCR(7.4pp)。问题是GSM8K的 inflation pattern极端非线性(3B爆炸式增长而0.5B/1.5B几乎不变)，IRT的线性γ×exposure\n278\t    无法捕捉这种scale-conditional effect。\n279\t\n280\t    HumanEval: N_items=164对4PL的thousands of parameters严重不足，convergence failure(Rhat=1.18)。\n281\t\n282\t    Coverage问题(75% vs 95% nominal)：SBC诊断显示rank histogram系统性over-concentrated near\n283\t    0.5，表明posterior width被低估。原因分解：(1)local independence violation—— single model responds\n284\t    to all items，item responses correlated through shared θ， 这种correlation被model忽略导致posterior\n285\t    artificially narrow；(2)N=26 models insufficient for reliable posterior estimation\n286\t    with数千个nuisance parameters(a,b,c,d per item)； (3)γ的scale-dependent effect direction\n287\t    misspecified。三者叠加导致20pp coverage gap。\n288\t\n289\t    Oracle-γ ablation(直接使用true contamination label)shows MAE可降到1.2-3.4pp， 证明IRT框架理论上可行，但γ\n290\t    estimation noise贡献了~4.2pp的额外error—— 在当前信号质量和N下，estimation noise dominates。\n291\t\n292\t    Dose-response monotonicity: 0.5B的deflation pattern导致4个violations(d005<d000在0.5B、\n293\t    d025<d005在0.5B、以及1.5B/3B的near-zero-with-noise fluctuations)。\n294\t\n295\t    '\n296\t  tables:\n297\t  - name: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark\n298\t    rows:\n299\t    - method: 'B0: Raw (no adjustment)'\n300\t      MMLU: 3.2\n301\t      ARC: 5.1\n302\t      GSM8K: 12.8\n303\t      HumanEval: 4.8\n304\t      mean: 6.5\n305\t    - method: 'B1: Remove-and-rescore'\n306\t      MMLU: 3.8\n307\t      ARC: 5.3\n308\t      GSM8K: 9.1\n309\t      HumanEval: 5.2\n310\t      mean: 5.9\n311\t    - method: 'B2: 2PL+γ (S1 only)'\n312\t      MMLU: 6.2\n313\t      ARC: 6.9\n314\t      GSM8K: 7.8\n315\t      HumanEval: 8.5\n316\t      mean: 7.4\n317\t    - method: 'B3: Vanilla 4PL (no γ)'\n318\t      MMLU: 5.4\n319\t      ARC: 6.1\n320\t      GSM8K: 10.2\n321\t      HumanEval: 7.3\n322\t      mean: 7.3\n323\t    - method: 'B4: Linear regression + bootstrap CI'\n324\t      MMLU: 3.9\n325\t      ARC: 4.8\n326\t      GSM8K: 6.2\n327\t      HumanEval: 4.1\n328\t      mean: 4.8\n329\t    - method: 'B5: Emperor''s mitigation'\n330\t      MMLU: 3.5\n331\t      ARC: 5.0\n332\t      GSM8K: 11.5\n333\t      HumanEval: 4.5\n334\t      mean: 6.1\n335\t    - method: 'B6: DCR fuzzy inference'\n336\t      MMLU: 4.5\n337\t      ARC: 5.6\n338\t      GSM8K: 7.4\n339\t      HumanEval: 5.8\n340\t      mean: 5.8\n341\t    - method: 4PL+γ (ours, per-benchmark)\n342\t      MMLU: 6.8\n343\t      ARC: 7.2\n344\t      GSM8K: 8.5\n345\t      HumanEval: 9.1\n346\t      mean: 7.9\n347\t    - method: 4PL+γ (ours, joint)\n348\t      MMLU: 7.5\n349\t      ARC: 8.1\n350\t      GSM8K: 9.2\n351\t      HumanEval: 10.3\n352\t      mean: 8.8\n353\t    - method: 4PL+γ (oracle γ)\n354\t      MMLU: 1.2\n355\t      ARC: 2.1\n356\t      GSM8K: 3.4\n357\t      HumanEval: 2.8\n358\t      mean: 2.4\n359\t  - name: Coverage and Sharpness (per-benchmark fit)\n360\t    rows:\n361\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n362\t      50% cov: 38\n363\t      80% cov: 59\n364\t      95% cov: 74\n365\t      95% CI width (pp): 19.3\n366\t    - benchmark: ARC\n367\t      50% cov: 35\n368\t      80% cov: 55\n369\t      95% cov: 72\n370\t      95% CI width (pp): 21.5\n371\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n372\t      50% cov: 42\n373\t      80% cov: 64\n374\t      95% cov: 78\n375\t      95% CI width (pp): 22.8\n376\t    - benchmark: HumanEval\n377\t      50% cov: 28\n378\t      80% cov: 48\n379\t      95% cov: 65\n380\t      95% CI width (pp): 24.1\n381\t  - name: γ Posterior Summary by Benchmark\n382\t    rows:\n383\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n384\t      gamma_mean: 0.018\n385\t      gamma_95ci: '[-0.14, 0.19]'\n386\t      excludes_zero: false\n387\t      theta_gamma_corr: 0.58\n388\t      rhat: 1.08\n389\t    - benchmark: ARC\n390\t      gamma_mean: -0.032\n391\t      gamma_95ci: '[-0.22, 0.16]'\n392\t      excludes_zero: false\n393\t      theta_gamma_corr: 0.72\n394\t      rhat: 1.12\n395\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n396\t      gamma_mean: 0.31\n397\t      gamma_95ci: '[0.04, 0.62]'\n398\t      excludes_zero: true\n399\t      theta_gamma_corr: 0.41\n400\t      rhat: 1.05\n401\t    - benchmark: HumanEval\n402\t      gamma_mean: 0.08\n403\t      gamma_95ci: '[-0.35, 0.52]'\n404\t      excludes_zero: false\n405\t      theta_gamma_corr: 0.63\n406\t      rhat: 1.18\n407\t  - name: SBC Diagnostic Summary\n408\t    rows:\n409\t    - parameter: gamma\n410\t      rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.003\n411\t      diagnosis: over-concentrated → posterior too narrow\n412\t    - parameter: theta\n413\t      rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.018\n414\t      diagnosis: mild over-concentration\n415\t    - parameter: item_a\n416\t      rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.142\n417\t      diagnosis: acceptable\n418\t    - parameter: item_b\n419\t      rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.067\n420\t      diagnosis: marginal\n421\t  figures_description:\n422\t  - 'Calibrated vs True accuracy scatter plot: 点高度散布在对角线两侧，95% CI error bars宽到12-25pp且许多不覆盖true\n423\t    value。与linear regression的tighter scatter形成对比。GSM8K 3B是唯一靠近对角线的outlier cluster。'\n424\t  - 'Dose-response curve: 0.5B的曲线向下(deflation)，1.5B/3B的曲线近乎水平(near-zero effect)。仅3B\n425\t    GSM8K有明显上升趋势。4个monotonicity violations用红叉标记。'\n426\t  - 'SBC rank histogram: γ的histogram明显tent-shaped(中间高两端低)，偏离uniform分布。p=0.003的K-S\n427\t    test结果标注。'\n428\t  - 'Oracle vs Estimated γ ablation bar chart: oracle-γ MAE(2.4pp)远低于estimated-γ(7.9pp)，差距5.5pp全部来自γ\n429\t    estimation error。'\n430\t  analysis: 'exp-006是worst档下最critical的negative result。核心发现：(1)4PL+γ IRT在所有benchmark上\n431\t    MAE劣于linear regression baseline(7.9pp vs 4.8pp mean)，IRT的额外复杂度(数千item parameters)在N=26\n432\t    models下导致overfitting而非better calibration；(2)γ CI仅在1/3 benchmark(GSM8K)excludes\n433\t    zero，且GSM8K的γ identification主要由3B的anomalous +58pp inflation驱动——去掉3B后GSM8K γ也不显著；(3)θ-γ\n434\t    correlation在ARC达0.72，接近严重混淆 阈值；(4)coverage gap达20pp(75% actual vs 95% nominal)，SBC确认是系统性model\n435\t    misspecification而非random variation。\n436\t\n437\t    但oracle-γ ablation(MAE=2.4pp)证明IRT框架theoretically sound——failure source是 γ estimation而非IRT本身。这为reframed\n438\t    paper提供关键narrative：''γ identification requires conditions not met in current setup(stronger\n439\t    signals, more models, scale-homogeneous effects)''——用Fisher Info identifiability分析理论解释failure\n440\t    boundary。\n441\t\n442\t    论文positioning：calibration results reported as ''informative negative result''\n443\t    with identifiability analysis explaining WHY it fails and WHAT conditions would\n444\t    make it work。 Linear regression baseline becomes the pragmatic recommendation。\n445\t\n446\t    '\n447\t- name: scale_bridging_7b\n448\t  plan_id: exp-007\n449\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B在5个dosage levels的controlled SFT injection。验证calibration是否\n450\t    scales to larger models。Worst档下7B延续3B的pattern——weak inflation使calibration无从着手。\n451\t\n452\t    '\n453\t  expected_results:\n454\t    mmlu_d000_accuracy: 0.712\n455\t    mmlu_d100_accuracy: 0.727\n456\t    mmlu_inflation_pp: 1.5\n457\t    arc_d000_accuracy: 0.878\n458\t    arc_d100_accuracy: 0.898\n459\t    arc_inflation_pp: 2.0\n460\t    gsm8k_d000_accuracy: 0.782\n461\t    gsm8k_d100_accuracy: 0.817\n462\t    gsm8k_inflation_pp: 3.5\n463\t    humaneval_d000_pass1: 0.305\n464\t    humaneval_d100_pass1: 0.354\n465\t    humaneval_inflation_pp: 4.9\n466\t    mmlu_dose_response_monotonic: false\n467\t    arc_dose_response_monotonic: true\n468\t    gsm8k_dose_response_monotonic: true\n469\t    S1_d005_auc_7B_mean: 0.948\n470\t    S2_d005_auc_7B_mean: 0.511\n471\t    S4_d005_auc_7B_mean: 0.528\n472\t    mmlu_4pl_gamma_mae_with_7B_pp: 6.5\n473\t    note: Adding 7B doesn't substantially change calibration because inflation is\n474\t      still weak\n475\t  result_rationale: '7B延续1.5B/3B的趋势：model capacity进一步增大使contamination的marginal effect继续缩小。\n476\t    MMLU inflation仅+1.5pp(7B已经在pre-training中见过大量knowledge→SFT contamination的 incremental\n477\t    effect minimal)。ARC和GSM8K有slightly larger inflation(+2.0pp, +3.5pp)但仍 远小于IRT可靠检测的threshold。MMLU\n478\t    dose-response非单调的原因：d005的SFT额外数据量太少( ~700 items)，noise dominates signal，7B在d005可能比d000略低(SFT\n479\t    data distribution shift)。 S2/S4在7B依然无效(AUC~0.51-0.53)——larger models的log-likelihood\n480\t    distribution更smooth， Min-K++的token-level statistic更难区分contaminated items。 加入7B到IRT\n481\t    fitting只增加~4个data points(d000/d005/d025/d100)， 且inflation pattern consistent with\n482\t    existing 1.5B/3B(weak)→不改变γ estimate。\n483\t\n484\t    '\n485\t  tables:\n486\t  - name: 7B Contamination Effect (Accuracy)\n487\t    rows:\n488\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n489\t      d000: 0.712\n490\t      d005: 0.71\n491\t      d025: 0.718\n492\t      d050: 0.721\n493\t      d100: 0.727\n494\t    - benchmark: ARC\n495\t      d000: 0.878\n496\t      d005: 0.88\n497\t      d025: 0.886\n498\t      d050: 0.891\n499\t      d100: 0.898\n500\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n501\t      d000: 0.782\n502\t      d005: 0.789\n503\t      d025: 0.795\n504\t      d050: 0.806\n505\t      d100: 0.817\n506\t    - benchmark: HumanEval\n507\t      d000: 0.305\n508\t      d005: 0.312\n509\t      d025: 0.328\n510\t      d050: 0.341\n511\t      d100: 0.354\n512\t  figures_description:\n513\t  - 7B dose-response curves叠加在0.5B/1.5B/3B曲线上：7B线几乎水平(slope~0.015pp/dosage-pct)，与0.5B的下降线和3B\n514\t    GSM8K的陡升线形成对比。视觉上reinforces'calibration target too weak'的narrative。\n515\t  analysis: '7B数据进一步确认worst档pattern：随着scale增大，contamination inflation趋于zero。这对 framework是existential\n516\t    threat——如果larger models(也是评估中最受关注的models)的contamination effect太小以至于不需要calibration，那么framework的practical\n517\t    relevance仅限于small models (哪里contamination反而是destructive的)。这个insight本身对reframed\n518\t    paper有价值—— ''contamination calibration is most needed where it''s hardest(small\n519\t    scale=destructive effect) and least needed where it''s easiest(large scale=negligible\n520\t    effect)''。\n521\t\n522\t    '\n523\t- name: signal_survival_analysis\n524\t  plan_id: exp-008\n525\t  description: '检测信号在不同training regime下的可靠性系统评估。0.5B SFT数据已有(exp_008_signal_survival_v4)。\n526\t    Worst档：signals在1.5B/3B SFT上无改善，RL-post-trained模型上进一步退化。\n527\t\n528\t    '\n529\t  expected_results:\n530\t    S1_sft_contaminated_auc_mean_15B: 0.962\n531\t    S1_sft_contaminated_auc_mean_3B: 0.951\n532\t    S2_sft_contaminated_auc_mean_15B: 0.483\n533\t    S2_sft_contaminated_auc_mean_3B: 0.502\n534\t    S4_sft_contaminated_auc_mean_15B: 0.494\n535\t    S4_sft_contaminated_auc_mean_3B: 0.519\n536\t    S1_instruct_auc_mean: 0.891\n537\t    S2_instruct_auc_mean: 0.478\n538\t    S4_instruct_auc_mean: 0.534\n539\t    S1_instruct_vs_sft_delta: -0.071\n540\t    S1_survives_sft: true\n541\t    S1_survives_rl_proxy: true\n542\t    S2_survives_any: false\n543\t    S3_survives_any: false\n544\t    S4_survives_any: false\n545\t    overall_signals_surviving_all_regimes: 1\n546\t    S2_reversal_at_15B: true\n547\t    S2_reversal_at_3B: true\n548\t    S2_reversal_cohens_d_range: '[-2.67, -1.22]'\n549\t  result_rationale: 'SFT regime的1.5B/3B结果直接继承exp-002的signal computation——scale上S2/S4保持无效。\n550\t    RL proxy(Instruct models)下S1 AUC从~0.96降至~0.89：RL fine-tuning改变了model的 embedding\n551\t    representation space，使embedding-based similarity的train-test matching变得 less precise(但仍>0.70因为semantic\n552\t    similarity is relatively robust to fine-tuning)。 S2(Min-K++)在RL下更差(0.478)因为RLHF改变了token-level\n553\t    likelihood distribution， 进一步扰乱Min-K++的基于perplexity的detection mechanism。S4(Self-Critique)在RL下\n554\t    有marginal improvement(0.534 vs 0.494-0.519)因为Instruct models更善于self-evaluation，\n555\t    但仍远低于useful threshold。\n556\t\n557\t    Min-K++反转在所有scale上一致(-1.22 to -2.67 Cohen''s d)，且在RL proxy下也存在—— 这是一个robust empirical\n558\t    finding，independent of scale and regime。\n559\t\n560\t    '\n561\t  tables:\n562\t  - name: Signal × Regime × Scale AUC Heatmap Data\n563\t    rows:\n564\t    - signal: S1\n565\t      regime: SFT-clean\n566\t      0.5B: 0.504\n567\t      1.5B: 0.508\n568\t      3B: 0.512\n569\t    - signal: S1\n570\t      regime: SFT-contam (d005)\n571\t      0.5B: 0.979\n572\t      1.5B: 0.962\n573\t      3B: 0.951\n574\t    - signal: S1\n575\t      regime: Instruct (RL proxy)\n576\t      0.5B: 0.882\n577\t      1.5B: 0.895\n578\t      3B: 0.897\n579\t    - signal: S2\n580\t      regime: SFT-clean\n581\t      0.5B: 0.501\n582\t      1.5B: 0.498\n583\t      3B: 0.503\n584\t    - signal: S2\n585\t      regime: SFT-contam (d005)\n586\t      0.5B: 0.465\n587\t      1.5B: 0.483\n588\t      3B: 0.502\n589\t    - signal: S2\n590\t      regime: Instruct (RL proxy)\n591\t      0.5B: 0.472\n592\t      1.5B: 0.481\n593\t      3B: 0.482\n594\t    - signal: S4\n595\t      regime: SFT-clean\n596\t      0.5B: 0.498\n597\t      1.5B: 0.502\n598\t      3B: 0.505\n599\t    - signal: S4\n600\t      regime: SFT-contam (d005)\n601\t      0.5B: 0.481\n602\t      1.5B: 0.494\n603\t      3B: 0.519\n604\t    - signal: S4\n605\t      regime: Instruct (RL proxy)\n606\t      0.5B: 0.522\n607\t      1.5B: 0.538\n608\t      3B: 0.541\n609\t  figures_description:\n610\t  - 4×3×3 AUC heatmap(signal × regime × scale)：S1行从左到右略有降低(SFT 0.97→RL 0.89)但始终在绿色区(>0.70)。S2/S4行全部在红色区(0.45-0.55)。视觉上极其明显的'only\n611\t    S1 works'pattern。\n612\t  - Min-K++ Cohen's d反转图：across所有scale和regime，bar全为负值。3D bar chart or grouped bar\n613\t    chart展示一致性。\n614\t  analysis: 'Signal survival analysis确认worst档的核心问题：信号diversity不存在。Paper的Core Contribution\n615\t    #2 (''signal effectiveness characterization'')的价值不在于发现''scale-dependent gradation''\n616\t    (这不成立)，而在于诚实记录''only embedding similarity survives across all conditions''。 Min-K++反转作为MIA\n617\t    cautionary tale的citation value不受影响——反而cross-scale/cross-regime 一致性使发现更robust。RL\n618\t    proxy下S1的~7pp AUC drop值得关注：如果RL training更aggressive (e.g., longer RL)，S1可能也会退化到<0.70threshold以下，这是未来工作的重要方向。\n619\t\n620\t    '\n621\t- name: rl_observational_case_study\n622\t  plan_id: exp-009\n623\t  description: '对existing RL-trained models(Qwen2.5-Instruct, DeepSeek-R1-Distill)应用ContamCal\n624\t    pipeline。 Worst档：CIs极宽，expected regret分析无informative结论。\n625\t\n626\t    '\n627\t  expected_results:\n628\t    S1_auc_qwen_instruct_mean: 0.891\n629\t    S1_auc_deepseek_r1_distill_mean: 0.862\n630\t    S2_auc_rl_models_mean: 0.479\n631\t    S4_auc_rl_models_mean: 0.536\n632\t    rl_gamma_posterior_mean: 0.08\n633\t    rl_gamma_95ci: '[-0.31, 0.48]'\n634\t    rl_gamma_ci_excludes_zero: false\n635\t    rl_95ci_coverage: 68\n636\t    rl_ci_width_mean_pp: 24.8\n637\t    top5_uncalibrated_vs_calibrated_rank_changes: 0\n638\t    expected_regret_uncalibrated_pp: 2.1\n639\t    expected_regret_calibrated_pp: 2.4\n640\t    expected_regret_remove_rescore_pp: 1.8\n641\t    regret_conclusion: calibration does not reduce expected regret; CIs too wide to\n642\t      be actionable\n643\t    known_clean_gamma_mean: 0.04\n644\t    known_clean_gamma_95ci: '[-0.18, 0.27]'\n645\t    known_clean_gamma_near_zero: true\n646\t    specificity_passes: true\n647\t  result_rationale: 'RL models的observational study面临三重困难：(1)没有ground truth clean scores——无法计算\n648\t    MAE，只能做internal consistency checks和regret analysis；(2)signal quality进一步降低—— S1在RL\n649\t    models上AUC=0.86-0.89(vs SFT的0.95+)，因为RL改变了embedding space； (3)N_models更少——仅6-8个models(不同scale的Instruct和R1-Distill\n650\t    variants)。\n651\t\n652\t    这三个问题叠加导致γ posterior极宽(CI=[-0.31, 0.48])，无法区分\"有contamination\"和 \"无contamination\"。Expected\n653\t    regret analysis显示calibrated ranking与uncalibrated ranking 几乎相同(0 rank changes in\n654\t    top-5)——不是因为calibration做得好，而是因为CIs太宽， calibrated scores本质上是uncalibrated scores加了大量noise。\n655\t    Remove-and-rescore的regret反而最低(1.8pp)因为它简单地丢弃flagged items，不需要估计γ。\n656\t\n657\t    Specificity check passes(known-clean benchmark的γ≈0)——这是一个small positive， 表明模型不会在clean\n658\t    data上hallucinate contamination effect。但这只说明false positive rate低，不说明true positive\n659\t    rate高。\n660\t\n661\t    '\n662\t  tables:\n663\t  - name: RL Models Calibration Summary\n664\t    rows:\n665\t    - model: Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\n666\t      S1_auc: 0.882\n667\t      gamma_mean: 0.12\n668\t      gamma_ci: '[-0.25, 0.51]'\n669\t      ci_width_pp: 26.3\n670\t    - model: Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n671\t      S1_auc: 0.895\n672\t      gamma_mean: 0.07\n673\t      gamma_ci: '[-0.28, 0.43]'\n674\t      ci_width_pp: 23.8\n675\t    - model: Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n676\t      S1_auc: 0.897\n677\t      gamma_mean: 0.05\n678\t      gamma_ci: '[-0.32, 0.41]'\n679\t      ci_width_pp: 24.1\n680\t    - model: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n681\t      S1_auc: 0.901\n682\t      gamma_mean: 0.03\n683\t      gamma_ci: '[-0.29, 0.35]'\n684\t      ci_width_pp: 22.4\n685\t    - model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\n686\t      S1_auc: 0.858\n687\t      gamma_mean: 0.14\n688\t      gamma_ci: '[-0.34, 0.62]'\n689\t      ci_width_pp: 28.1\n690\t    - model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n691\t      S1_auc: 0.866\n692\t      gamma_mean: 0.09\n693\t      gamma_ci: '[-0.30, 0.49]'\n694\t      ci_width_pp: 25.7\n695\t  - name: Expected Regret Comparison (top-5 model selection)\n696\t    rows:\n697\t    - method: Uncalibrated\n698\t      regret_pp: 2.1\n699\t      rank_changes_vs_oracle: 1\n700\t    - method: 4PL+γ calibrated\n701\t      regret_pp: 2.4\n702\t      rank_changes_vs_oracle: 1\n703\t    - method: Remove-and-rescore\n704\t      regret_pp: 1.8\n705\t      rank_changes_vs_oracle: 0\n706\t  figures_description:\n707\t  - RL models的calibrated score forest plot：每个model一行，point estimate + 95% CI bar。CI\n708\t    bars全部overlap，无法区分任何pair of models。与controlled SFT models的tighter CIs(如果有的话)形成对比。\n709\t  analysis: 'RL observational study确认worst档预期：calibration在RL regime下uninformative。\n710\t    但specificity check(clean benchmark γ≈0)至少表明框架不会produce harmful false positives。\n711\t    论文中frame为''current signal quality insufficient for RL models, but framework correctly\n712\t    expresses this uncertainty through wide CIs''——honest UQ rather than overconfident\n713\t    wrong answers。DeepSeek-R1-Distill的S1 AUC更低(0.86 vs 0.89)可能因为distillation 进一步distorted\n714\t    embedding space。这motivates future work on RL-robust signals。\n715\t\n716\t    '\n717\t- name: observational_72b\n718\t  plan_id: exp-012\n719\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B inference-only observational分析。Worst档：无ground truth，CIs宽，\n720\t    结论完全inconclusive。\n721\t\n722\t    '\n723\t  expected_results:\n724\t    S1_auc_72B: 0.938\n725\t    S2_auc_72B: 0.508\n726\t    S4_auc_72B: 0.542\n727\t    gamma_mean: 0.02\n728\t    gamma_95ci: '[-0.41, 0.45]'\n729\t    gamma_ci_excludes_zero: false\n730\t    ci_width_pp: 28.5\n731\t    calibrated_vs_raw_delta_pp: 0.4\n732\t    note: Single model, no ground truth — purely qualitative\n733\t  result_rationale: '72B的observational analysis面临最严峻的identifiability challenge：(1)单个model→N_models=1，\n734\t    IRT无法fit(需要至少~20 models)。只能做per-item exposure scoring和descriptive analysis。 (2)无ground\n735\t    truth→MAE不可计算。(3)72B在所有benchmark上accuracy已接近ceiling(MMLU~0.83, ARC~0.94)→即使有contamination，其marginal\n736\t    inflation effect更小(ceiling compression)。 γ estimate来自在controlled models上fitted\n737\t    model的extrapolation到72B—— 但72B的θ远超training range，extrapolation unreliable。CI width=28.5pp使结果\n738\t    完全uninformative。Calibrated score与raw score差距仅0.4pp，在noise中不可检测。\n739\t\n740\t    '\n741\t  tables:\n742\t  - name: 72B Observational Summary (inference only)\n743\t    rows:\n744\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n745\t      raw_acc: 0.831\n746\t      calibrated_acc: 0.827\n747\t      delta_pp: -0.4\n748\t      ci_width_pp: 27.1\n749\t    - benchmark: ARC\n750\t      raw_acc: 0.941\n751\t      calibrated_acc: 0.938\n752\t      delta_pp: -0.3\n753\t      ci_width_pp: 22.8\n754\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n755\t      raw_acc: 0.892\n756\t      calibrated_acc: 0.885\n757\t      delta_pp: -0.7\n758\t      ci_width_pp: 31.4\n759\t    - benchmark: HumanEval\n760\t      raw_acc: 0.793\n761\t      calibrated_acc: 0.788\n762\t      delta_pp: -0.5\n763\t      ci_width_pp: 32.8\n764\t  figures_description:\n765\t  - 72B单点在calibrated-vs-true scatter中的位置：一个点，巨大的error bar(±14pp)，完全uninformative。用来illustrate'为什么single-model\n766\t    observational analysis不足以validate calibration'。\n767\t  analysis: '72B分析在worst档下几乎无信息价值。唯一可用的finding是exposure score分布的descriptive statistics——哪些benchmark\n768\t    items在72B上有高S1 exposure scores。但这只是signal characterization， 不是calibration。论文中作为1-2段discussion\n769\t    item处理，frame为''ecological validity extension requires multi-model observational\n770\t    study design''。不在main results中占位。\n771\t\n772\t    '\n773\t- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n774\t  plan_id: exp-013\n775\t  description: '仅ConStat + Self-Critique(无logits/embeddings)的degraded 2-signal mode。\n776\t    Worst档：两个信号都在chance水平→closed-weight calibration完全不可行。\n777\t\n778\t    '\n779\t  expected_results:\n780\t    constat_auc_mean_across_scales: 0.524\n781\t    selfcritique_auc_mean_across_scales: 0.511\n782\t    rrf_2signal_auc_mean: 0.521\n783\t    mae_2signal_vs_4signal_gap_pp: 5.8\n784\t    mae_2signal_calibration_pp: 13.7\n785\t    mae_raw_pp: 6.5\n786\t    note: 2-signal calibration WORSE than doing nothing (raw scores)\n787\t    coverage_2signal_95pct: 58\n788\t    ci_width_2signal_pp: 32.4\n789\t  result_rationale: 'ConStat(AUC~0.52)和Self-Critique(AUC~0.51)都接近random chance。两个random\n790\t    signals的 RRF fusion仍然是random(AUC=0.521)。基于这种noise exposure score做IRT calibration\n791\t    不仅不帮助，还actively harmful——γ估计受random exposure scores驱动，产生spurious corrections，MAE=13.7pp远高于raw\n792\t    scores(6.5pp)。Coverage仅58%(95% nominal)因为 CI既宽(32.4pp)又biased(wrong γ direction\n793\t    on some models)。\n794\t\n795\t    这个结果有clear practical implication：closed-weight model evaluation(GPT-4, Claude等)\n796\t    目前不可能做contamination calibration，因为available signals(无logits)完全无效。\n797\t\n798\t    '\n799\t  tables:\n800\t  - name: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration Comparison\n801\t    rows:\n802\t    - metric: Exposure AUC\n803\t      4-signal: 0.958\n804\t      2-signal: 0.521\n805\t      S1-only: 0.964\n806\t    - metric: MAE (pp)\n807\t      4-signal: 7.9\n808\t      2-signal: 13.7\n809\t      S1-only: 7.5\n810\t    - metric: 95% Coverage\n811\t      4-signal: 75\n812\t      2-signal: 58\n813\t      S1-only: 76\n814\t    - metric: CI Width (pp)\n815\t      4-signal: 21.2\n816\t      2-signal: 32.4\n817\t      S1-only: 20.8\n818\t  figures_description:\n819\t  - 2-signal vs 4-signal comparison bar chart：MAE/coverage/sharpness三个metric上2-signal全面崩溃。附注'raw\n820\t    scores outperform 2-signal calibration'。\n821\t  analysis: 'Closed-weight calibration不可行是worst档下的strong negative result。论文中不应隐瞒——\n822\t    在Limitations中明确指出''ContamCal requires embedding access(open-weight models)''。\n823\t    这限制了framework的practical applicability到open-weight models only。在reframed paper中，\n824\t    这成为''identifiability boundary''的另一个dimension：不仅需要AUC≥0.70和N≥30， 还需要embedding access。\n825\t\n826\t    '\n827\t- name: multi_family_validation\n828\t  plan_id: exp-014\n829\t  description: 'Llama-3.2-1B或Pythia-1.4B在3个dosage levels的controlled SFT injection。\n830\t    Worst档：cross-family contamination response pattern截然不同，γ estimates不transferable。\n831\t\n832\t    '\n833\t  expected_results:\n834\t    llama_mmlu_d000: 0.312\n835\t    llama_mmlu_d100: 0.285\n836\t    llama_mmlu_inflation_pp: -2.7\n837\t    llama_arc_d000: 0.398\n838\t    llama_arc_d100: 0.361\n839\t    llama_arc_inflation_pp: -3.7\n840\t    llama_gsm8k_d000: 0.182\n841\t    llama_gsm8k_d100: 0.201\n842\t    llama_gsm8k_inflation_pp: 1.9\n843\t    gamma_cross_family_correlation: 0.31\n844\t    gamma_qwen_mmlu: 0.018\n845\t    gamma_llama_mmlu: -0.085\n846\t    gamma_agreement_direction: false\n847\t    S1_llama_auc_d005: 0.941\n848\t    S2_llama_auc_d005: 0.472\n849\t    S4_llama_auc_d005: 0.488\n850\t  result_rationale: 'Llama-3.2-1B(~1B parameters)在contamination response上类似Qwen2.5-0.5B而非1.5B——\n851\t    因为absolute model capacity而非parameter count决定contamination effect direction。 1B-class\n852\t    models普遍suffer from catastrophic forgetting when SFT data includes benchmark items\n853\t    (SFT data分布偏移干扰模型原有knowledge)。MMLU和ARC都出现deflation(-2.7pp, -3.7pp)， 与Qwen2.5-0.5B的pattern一致。\n854\t\n855\t    Cross-family γ correlation仅0.31(远低于paper_framing中期望的r=0.91)——这直接否定了 ''contamination\n856\t    susceptibility is a benchmark property''的claim。γ differences across families reflect不同的architecture/pretraining\n857\t    data/tokenizer导致的不同contamination response patterns。 Qwen和Llama在同一benchmark上甚至γ方向都不一致(Qwen\n858\t    MMLU γ>0 vs Llama MMLU γ<0)。\n859\t\n860\t    S1 AUC在Llama上依然高(0.941)——embedding similarity是model-agnostic的。S2/S4继续失败。\n861\t\n862\t    '\n863\t  tables:\n864\t  - name: Cross-family Contamination Effect Comparison\n865\t    rows:\n866\t    - family: Qwen2.5-0.5B\n867\t      MMLU_delta: -16.5\n868\t      ARC_delta: -17.5\n869\t      GSM8K_delta: -0.4\n870\t    - family: Qwen2.5-1.5B\n871\t      MMLU_delta: 0.8\n872\t      ARC_delta: -0.3\n873\t      GSM8K_delta: -0.5\n874\t    - family: Qwen2.5-3B\n875\t      MMLU_delta: 0.8\n876\t      ARC_delta: 1.2\n877\t      GSM8K_delta: 57.7\n878\t    - family: Llama-3.2-1B\n879\t      MMLU_delta: -2.7\n880\t      ARC_delta: -3.7\n881\t      GSM8K_delta: 1.9\n882\t  - name: Cross-family γ Estimates\n883\t    rows:\n884\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n885\t      qwen_gamma: 0.018\n886\t      llama_gamma: -0.085\n887\t      correlation: 0.31\n888\t    - benchmark: ARC\n889\t      qwen_gamma: -0.032\n890\t      llama_gamma: -0.112\n891\t      correlation: 0.58\n892\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n893\t      qwen_gamma: 0.31\n894\t      llama_gamma: 0.065\n895\t      correlation: 0.22\n896\t  figures_description:\n897\t  - Cross-family dose-response curves并列：Qwen vs Llama在同一benchmark上方向不同(MMLU)或magnitude差异大(GSM8K)。Shaded\n898\t    areas表示within-family variation vs between-family variation。\n899\t  analysis: 'Multi-family validation失败是worst档的predicted outcome但也是valuable negative\n900\t    result。 它证明contamination effect is NOT a benchmark property——it''s a benchmark\n901\t    × model family interaction。这从根本上限制了framework的generalizability：在Qwen上trained的γ\n902\t    estimates 不能transfer到Llama/Pythia。论文需要在Limitations中明确说明''current framework requires\n903\t    per-family calibration''。\n904\t\n905\t    对reframed paper的影响：(1) per-benchmark γ_k heterogeneity的cross-family r=0.91 claim\n906\t    完全放弃；(2)Identifiability分析需要增加''family-specific''维度——每个model family都需要 独立的N≥30和AUC≥0.70；(3)作为rebuttal\n907\t    experiment的价值反而增加——诚实报告cross-family failure比假装成功更有说服力。\n908\t\n909\t    '\n910\t- name: simulation_identifiability_sweep_v2_final\n911\t  plan_id: exp-004\n912\t  description: '144-condition simulation sweep的最终结果(v2 currently RUNNING, 48/120 complete)。\n913\t    Worst档下模拟在idealized conditions下works，但gap to real data conditions不可弥合。\n914\t\n915\t    '\n916\t  expected_results:\n917\t    auc055_n20_gamma_rmse: 0.04\n918\t    auc055_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.026\n919\t    auc055_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.013\n920\t    auc080_n20_gamma_rmse: 0.035\n921\t    auc080_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.018\n922\t    auc080_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.008\n923\t    structural_identifiability_threshold_auc: 0.55\n924\t    practical_identifiability_threshold_auc: 0.7\n925\t    practical_identifiability_threshold_n: 50\n926\t    sim_95ci_coverage_auc080_n50: 94\n927\t    sim_95ci_coverage_auc055_n20: 82\n928\t    fisher_info_gamma_theoretical: I(γ) ∝ N × (AUC - 0.5)² / σ²_exposure\n929\t    fisher_info_minimum_auc_for_10pct_precision: 0.72\n930\t    real_data_effective_auc: 0.96\n931\t    real_data_effective_n: 26\n932\t    real_data_sim_predicted_rmse: 0.012\n933\t    real_data_actual_rmse: '>0.15'\n934\t    sim_to_real_gap_factor: '>12×'\n935\t    gap_explanation: simulation assumes correct model spec + local independence; real\n936\t      data violates both\n937\t    sbc_at_n26_sim: pass (p=0.34)\n938\t    sbc_at_n26_real: fail (p=0.003)\n939\t  result_rationale: 'Simulation sweep在idealized conditions下展示出令人鼓舞的结果——即使AUC=0.55(near\n940\t    chance)， γ也structurally identifiable(RMSE=0.04 at N=20)。这本身是一个有价值的理论贡献。 但worst档的核心问题是sim-to-real\n941\t    gap：simulation中(1)model specification完全正确 (data generating process = fitted model)，(2)local\n942\t    independence holds(每个examinee 独立)，(3)exposure scores按exact AUC level生成(no distribution\n943\t    mismatch)。\n944\t\n945\t    Real data违反所有三个假设：(1)contamination effect is scale-dependent(model misspecified)，\n946\t    (2)single model responds to all items(local independence violated)，(3)exposure\n947\t    AUC=0.96但 inflation near-zero(high AUC doesn''t help when there''s nothing to\n948\t    calibrate)。 因此simulation RMSE=0.012预测的精度在real data上inflated 12×以上。\n949\t\n950\t    Fisher Information analysis gives I(γ) ∝ N × (AUC-0.5)² / σ²_e。在real conditions，\n951\t    AUC=0.96 gives (0.96-0.5)²=0.2116——似乎足够。但这个公式假设γ的true effect is non-zero 且model\n952\t    correctly specified。当true γ≈0(1.5B/3B MMLU/ARC)，Fisher Info对precision 的保证变成\"we\n953\t    can precisely estimate that γ≈0\"——which is correct but useless for calibration。\n954\t\n955\t    SBC通过simulation(p=0.34)但fail on real data(p=0.003)——quantitative evidence for\n956\t    sim-to-real gap。\n957\t\n958\t    '\n959\t  tables:\n960\t  - name: Simulation γ Recovery (RMSE) by AUC × N_models\n961\t    rows:\n962\t    - AUC: 0.55\n963\t      N_20: 0.04\n964\t      N_50: 0.026\n965\t      N_100: 0.013\n966\t      N_200: 0.007\n967\t    - AUC: 0.6\n968\t      N_20: 0.038\n969\t      N_50: 0.023\n970\t      N_100: 0.011\n971\t      N_200: 0.006\n972\t    - AUC: 0.65\n973\t      N_20: 0.036\n974\t      N_50: 0.021\n975\t      N_100: 0.01\n976\t      N_200: 0.005\n977\t    - AUC: 0.7\n978\t      N_20: 0.034\n979\t      N_50: 0.019\n980\t      N_100: 0.009\n981\t      N_200: 0.005\n982\t    - AUC: 0.8\n983\t      N_20: 0.035\n984\t      N_50: 0.018\n985\t      N_100: 0.008\n986\t      N_200: 0.004\n987\t    - AUC: 0.9\n988\t      N_20: 0.033\n989\t      N_50: 0.017\n990\t      N_100: 0.008\n991\t      N_200: 0.004\n992\t  - name: Sim-to-Real Gap\n993\t    rows:\n994\t    - condition: AUC=0.96 N=26\n995\t      sim_rmse: 0.012\n996\t      real_rmse: '>0.15'\n997\t      gap: '>12×'\n998\t    - condition: SBC p-value\n999\t      sim: 0.34\n1000\t      real: 0.003\n1001\t      interpretation: model correctly specified in sim, misspecified in real\n1002\t  figures_description:\n1003\t  - 'Identifiability phase diagram: AUC (x-axis) × N_models (y-axis)，颜色编码γ RMSE。Structural\n1004\t    boundary at AUC≈0.55(虚线)，practical boundary at AUC≈0.70(实线)。Red star标注real data\n1005\t    conditions(AUC=0.96, N=26)——位于''应该work''的区域，但实际doesn''t。'\n1006\t  - 'Sim-to-real gap scatter: x=predicted RMSE from sim，y=actual RMSE from real data。所有点远离对角线(actual\n1007\t    >> predicted)。'\n1008\t  analysis: 'Identifiability分析是worst档下仍然valuable的独立贡献——它gives理论lower bounds。 但必须诚实报告sim-to-real\n1009\t    gap：''simulation establishes necessary conditions(AUC≥0.55 structural, ≥0.70 practical),\n1010\t    but these are NOT sufficient conditions in real data where model assumptions are\n1011\t    violated''。这naturally leads to future work：(1)hierarchical IRT accounting for\n1012\t    scale-dependent effects, (2)N_models >> 50 to overcome local independence violation,\n1013\t    (3)multiple model families for robust estimation。\n1014\t\n1015\t    Fisher Info derivation作为appendix material仍然有theory贡献：明确了I(γ)与AUC、N、σ_e 的关系，为未来工作提供了quantitative\n1016\t    design criteria。\n1017\t\n1018\t    '\n1019\t- name: noise_propagation_analysis_v3_final\n1020\t  plan_id: exp-005\n1021\t  description: 'Measurement error model(exposure as noisy observation of latent τ)的最终结果。\n1022\t    v1和v2已failed。Worst档：ME model收敛但不改善coverage，noise propagation正确但insufficient to\n1023\t    compensate for model misspecification。\n1024\t\n1025\t    '\n1026\t  expected_results:\n1027\t    me_model_converges: true\n1028\t    me_rhat_max: 1.04\n1029\t    me_ess_min: 312\n1030\t    point_estimate_95ci_coverage: 75\n1031\t    me_model_95ci_coverage: 79\n1032\t    me_coverage_improvement_pp: 4\n1033\t    target_coverage: 95\n1034\t    coverage_gap_remaining: 16\n1035\t    me_ci_width_mean_pp: 23.8\n1036\t    point_estimate_ci_width_pp: 21.2\n1037\t    me_ci_widening_pp: 2.6\n1038\t    me_mae_pp: 7.3\n1039\t    point_estimate_mae_pp: 7.9\n1040\t    me_mae_improvement_pp: 0.6\n1041\t    noise_1x_ci_widening_pct: 8\n1042\t    noise_1_5x_ci_widening_pct: 15\n1043\t    noise_2x_ci_widening_pct: 28\n1044\t  result_rationale: 'ME model在技术上works：它correctly propagates exposure uncertainty\n1045\t    into posterior， 产生slightly wider CIs(+2.6pp)和slightly better coverage(+4pp)。但coverage\n1046\t    improvement from 75%→79%远不足以close 20pp gap to 95% nominal。原因：exposure measurement\n1047\t    error 只是coverage gap的minor contributor(~15% per SBC attribution)。主要原因是local independence\n1048\t    violation(~60%)和model misspecification(~25%)——ME model不address these。\n1049\t\n1050\t    Post-hoc noise injection实验shows CI widening scales linearly with noise level (as\n1051\t    expected from theory)——这validates the ME model mechanics。但即使at 2× noise， CIs only\n1052\t    widen 28%，coverage仅reaches ~83%——still below 95%。\n1053\t\n1054\t    ME model作为D025 framing中的''if improves coverage → report; otherwise → ablation''\n1055\t    decision node：in worst tier, it''s an ablation item. Simple model(point-estimate\n1056\t    exposure) is primary because ME model adds complexity without closing the coverage\n1057\t    gap。\n1058\t\n1059\t    '\n1060\t  tables:\n1061\t  - name: Measurement Error Model vs Point-Estimate Comparison\n1062\t    rows:\n1063\t    - metric: MAE (pp)\n1064\t      point_estimate: 7.9\n1065\t      ME_model: 7.3\n1066\t      delta: -0.6\n1067\t    - metric: 95% Coverage (%)\n1068\t      point_estimate: 75\n1069\t      ME_model: 79\n1070\t      delta: 4\n1071\t    - metric: 95% CI Width (pp)\n1072\t      point_estimate: 21.2\n1073\t      ME_model: 23.8\n1074\t      delta: 2.6\n1075\t    - metric: Kendall τ\n1076\t      point_estimate: 0.69\n1077\t      ME_model: 0.7\n1078\t      delta: 0.01\n1079\t    - metric: Rhat max\n1080\t      point_estimate: 1.12\n1081\t      ME_model: 1.04\n1082\t      delta: -0.08\n1083\t  figures_description:\n1084\t  - 'Coverage calibration plot: nominal coverage (x) vs actual coverage (y)。Point-estimate线和ME-model线都在对角线下方(under-coverage)，ME-model线slightly\n1085\t    closer to diagonal but still far off。'\n1086\t  analysis: ME model是worst档下的minor positive：它technically works but doesn't solve the\n1087\t    core problem。 论文中作为ablation报告：'measurement error model improves convergence(Rhat\n1088\t    1.12→1.04) and modestly improves coverage(75%→79%), but the dominant coverage\n1089\t    gap source is local independence violation which requires structural model changes(e.g.,\n1090\t    hierarchical IRT or random-effects item parameters), not exposure noise propagation。'\n1091\t    这strengthens identifiability分析的narrative——even with proper noise handling， fundamental\n1092\t    model limitations remain。\n1093\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"954a1c9c-91aa-4a2c-9a8d-36637afa1d31","uuid":"d1cd2438-3d77-4614-84c1-47f02fb72d06","timestamp":"2026-05-14T20:07:28.750Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T185145/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心框架claim不成立：(1) γ在真实数据上因scale-dependent contamination effect方向不一致\n  （0.5B deflation vs 1.5B/3B near-zero inflation）导致不可靠估计，per-benchmark γ_k在不同scale上\n  表现为不同符号，模型假设的单一γ根本无法捕捉这种异质性；(2) IRT复杂度无回报——线性回归基线 利用exposure score做简单调整即可达到相当甚至更优的MAE；(3)\n  仅S1有效+N_models不足30的双重打击 使得Fisher Information不足以支撑reliable γ estimation。需根本性reframe为\n  ''When Can We Calibrate Contaminated Benchmarks?''——用identifiability分析和信号characterization\n  作为核心贡献，calibration框架降级为informative negative result。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '在exp-001产出的1.5B和3B全dosage模型上计算4个检测信号。0.5B数据已有(exp_002_signals_05B)。\n    Worst档下S2/S4在1.5B/3B依然不起作用，S3(ConStat)因inflation极小而无discriminative power。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    S1_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.962\n    S1_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.974\n    S1_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.988\n    S1_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.951\n    S1_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.968\n    S1_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.982\n    S2_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.483\n    S2_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.502\n    S2_d100_cohens_d_15B_mean: -1.52\n    S2_d100_cohens_d_3B_mean: -1.22\n    S3_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.518\n    S3_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.531\n    S4_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.494\n    S4_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.519\n    effective_signals_15B: 1\n    effective_signals_3B: 1\n    signals_with_auc_above_070_across_all_scales: S1 only\n  result_rationale: 'S1(embedding similarity)检测的是train-test文本重叠而非模型行为变化，因此与model scale无关，\n    在所有scale上保持AUC>0.95。S2(Min-K++)依赖token-level log-likelihood分布偏移来检测 memorization；但在1.5B/3B上模型capacity足够大，contaminated\n    items不产生显著的 perplexity下降(因为模型即使没见过也能答对大部分MC题)，导致contaminated与clean items的 log-likelihood分布高度重叠(AUC≈0.50)。d100反转效应(Cohen''s\n    d<0)是因为100%contamination 使整体perplexity分布shift，Min-K++的rank-based statistic反而把contaminated\n    items排到 低风险端。S3(ConStat)需要original→paraphrase的performance gap，但1.5B/3B在MMLU/ARC上\n    inflation<2pp，gap在item-level noise中被淹没。S4(Self-Critique)需要模型在contaminated items上表现出entropy\n    collapse，但1.5B/3B的contamination几乎不改变response distribution。 总结：所有scale上只有S1可用，\"scale-dependent\n    signal effectiveness\"这一claim的 \"scale-dependent\"部分无法验证——正确描述是\"method-specific signal\n    effectiveness\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Signal × Scale × Dosage AUC Matrix (item-level, d005)\n    rows:\n    - signal: S1_Embedding\n      0.5B: 0.979\n      1.5B: 0.962\n      3B: 0.951\n    - signal: S2_MinKPP\n      0.5B: 0.465\n      1.5B: 0.483\n      3B: 0.502\n    - signal: S3_ConStat\n      0.5B: 0.51\n      1.5B: 0.518\n      3B: 0.531\n    - signal: S4_SelfCritique\n      0.5B: 0.481\n      1.5B: 0.494\n      3B: 0.519\n  - name: Cross-model Cohen's d at d100 vs d000\n    rows:\n    - signal: S1_Embedding\n      0.5B: 3.6\n      1.5B: 2.85\n      3B: 2.41\n    - signal: S2_MinKPP\n      0.5B: -1.98\n      1.5B: -1.52\n      3B: -1.22\n    - signal: S3_ConStat\n      0.5B: 0.32\n      1.5B: 0.18\n      3B: 0.22\n    - signal: S4_SelfCritique\n      0.5B: 0.45\n      1.5B: 0.38\n      3B: 0.51\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Signal AUC heatmap: 4 signals × 3 scales × 3 dosages(d005/d025/d100)。视觉上呈现S1一行全亮(>0.95)，S2-S4三行全暗(~0.50)的极端二分格局。与best/mid档预期的''scale-dependent\n    gradient''形成鲜明对比。'\n  - Min-K++ Cohen's d方向性反转图：3个scale的bar chart，全部为负值(从-1.98到-1.22)，标注cautionary tale\n    for MIA-based detection。\n  analysis: '该结果确认\"scale-dependent\"主张不成立——S2/S4在任何scale上都无discriminative power。 论文C2\n    contingency触发：降级为\"method-specific signal effectiveness\"，RRF讨论移至 Limitations。S1的单独有效性仍是有价值的发现(AUC>0.95\n    across scales)，但RRF作为 \"principled multi-signal aggregation\"的卖点完全落空——它只是S1的一层wrapper。\n    Min-K++反转(Cohen''s d=-1.22 to -1.98)作为MIA文献的cautionary tale依然是最强引用 贡献，且cross-scale一致性(所有scale都反转)增强了这一发现的robustness。\n\n    '\n- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 'RRF融合4个信号为composite exposure score，加上单信号/等权/加权/2-signal等ablation。\n    0.5B部分数据已有(exp_003_rrf_05B)。Worst档下RRF ≈ S1，多信号融合无增益。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    rrf_4signal_auc_d005_mean: 0.958\n    s1_only_auc_d005_mean: 0.964\n    rrf_vs_s1_delta: -0.006\n    equal_weight_avg_auc_d005_mean: 0.782\n    calibration_weighted_rrf_auc_d005_mean: 0.961\n    constat_selfcritique_2signal_auc_d005_mean: 0.521\n    rrf_auc_at_5pct_fp_injection: 0.949\n    rrf_auc_at_10pct_fp_injection: 0.931\n    rrf_4signal_auc_range_across_scales: '[0.948, 0.965]'\n    s1_only_auc_range_across_scales: '[0.951, 0.979]'\n  result_rationale: 'RRF的rank fusion机制在3/4信号都是noise时退化为dominant signal mode：S1的high-AUC\n    ranks(接近完美排序)dominate，S2/S3/S4的random ranks被平均掉但也引入额外噪声。因此 RRF(0.958)略低于S1-only(0.964)——噪声信号的inclusion是net\n    negative。等权平均更差 (0.782)因为3个random signals直接稀释S1。Calibration-weighted RRF(0.961)接近S1因为\n    weights自动将S2-S4权重压到~0。2-signal closed-weight mode(ConStat+Self-Critique) AUC=0.521是灾难性的——两个无效信号的fusion仍然无效，意味着closed-weight\n    model calibration完全不可行。FP robustness check显示RRF/S1在5-10% FP注入下AUC下降<3%， 这是因为S1的基础信号足够强。但这不改变核心问题：multi-signal\n    aggregation的whole point (robustness through diversity)在当前条件下无法实现。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Aggregation Method Comparison (d005, item-level AUC)\n    rows:\n    - method: RRF (4 signals)\n      0.5B: 0.961\n      1.5B: 0.955\n      3B: 0.948\n      mean: 0.958\n    - method: S1 only\n      0.5B: 0.979\n      1.5B: 0.962\n      3B: 0.951\n      mean: 0.964\n    - method: Equal-weight avg\n      0.5B: 0.801\n      1.5B: 0.776\n      3B: 0.768\n      mean: 0.782\n    - method: Calibration-weighted RRF\n      0.5B: 0.975\n      1.5B: 0.959\n      3B: 0.949\n      mean: 0.961\n    - method: 2-signal (S3+S4)\n      0.5B: 0.508\n      1.5B: 0.519\n      3B: 0.537\n      mean: 0.521\n  - name: RRF Degradation Under FP Injection\n    rows:\n    - fp_rate: 0%\n      auc: 0.958\n    - fp_rate: 5%\n      auc: 0.949\n    - fp_rate: 10%\n      auc: 0.931\n    - fp_rate: 15%\n      auc: 0.908\n  figures_description:\n  - Bar chart对比5种aggregation方法的AUC：S1-only与RRF几乎等高，equal-weight显著低于两者，2-signal在chance水平。视觉上传达'multi-signal\n    aggregation = S1 with extra steps'的message。\n  analysis: '核心发现：RRF ≤ S1-only。这直接触发Reviewer Concern #18 (''Why not just S1?'')和\n    #13 (''RRF is just S1?'')的defensive response。论文需诚实报告：当前条件下multi-signal aggregation无增益，S1-only是实质上的信号来源。RRF的价值被reframe为\"extensible\n    architecture for future signals\"而非当前的性能贡献。2-signal mode的彻底失败(AUC=0.521)意味着 closed-weight\n    model calibration在Related Work/Future Work中被标记为open problem。 Meta-circularity\n    argument for training-free aggregation仍然成立但显得academic—— 当只有一个有效信号时，是否需要aggregation\n    framework本身成为问题。\n\n    '\n- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: '4PL+γ IRT模型拟合+7个baselines对比。Per-benchmark fitting为primary，joint fitting为ablation。\n    已有exp_006_irt_05B_gsm8k的失败先例(per-benchmark Rhat=1.53; IRT MAE 0.0195 > Raw MAE\n    0.0034)。 Worst档下IRT在所有benchmark上不优于linear regression baseline，coverage严重低于nominal。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_total: 26\n    n_models_with_3seeds: 18\n    n_models_with_2seeds: 22\n    mmlu_4pl_gamma_mae_pp: 6.8\n    mmlu_linear_reg_mae_pp: 3.9\n    mmlu_raw_mae_pp: 3.2\n    mmlu_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp: 5.4\n    mmlu_2pl_gamma_mae_pp: 6.2\n    mmlu_remove_rescore_mae_pp: 3.8\n    mmlu_dcr_mae_pp: 4.5\n    mmlu_emperor_mae_pp: 3.5\n    mmlu_gamma_posterior_mean: 0.018\n    mmlu_gamma_posterior_95ci: '[-0.14, 0.19]'\n    mmlu_gamma_ci_excludes_zero: false\n    mmlu_95ci_coverage: 74\n    mmlu_ci_width_mean_pp: 19.3\n    mmlu_kendall_tau: 0.71\n    mmlu_rhat_max: 1.08\n    mmlu_ess_min: 142\n    arc_4pl_gamma_mae_pp: 7.2\n    arc_linear_reg_mae_pp: 4.8\n    arc_raw_mae_pp: 5.1\n    arc_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp: 6.1\n    arc_2pl_gamma_mae_pp: 6.9\n    arc_remove_rescore_mae_pp: 5.3\n    arc_dcr_mae_pp: 5.6\n    arc_emperor_mae_pp: 5.0\n    arc_gamma_posterior_mean: -0.032\n    arc_gamma_posterior_95ci: '[-0.22, 0.16]'\n    arc_gamma_ci_excludes_zero: false\n    arc_95ci_coverage: 72\n    arc_ci_width_mean_pp: 21.5\n    arc_kendall_tau: 0.65\n    arc_rhat_max: 1.12\n    arc_ess_min: 87\n    gsm8k_4pl_gamma_mae_pp: 8.5\n    gsm8k_linear_reg_mae_pp: 6.2\n    gsm8k_raw_mae_pp: 12.8\n    gsm8k_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp: 10.2\n    gsm8k_2pl_gamma_mae_pp: 7.8\n    gsm8k_remove_rescore_mae_pp: 9.1\n    gsm8k_dcr_mae_pp: 7.4\n    gsm8k_emperor_mae_pp: 11.5\n    gsm8k_gamma_posterior_mean: 0.31\n    gsm8k_gamma_posterior_95ci: '[0.04, 0.62]'\n    gsm8k_gamma_ci_excludes_zero: true\n    gsm8k_95ci_coverage: 78\n    gsm8k_ci_width_mean_pp: 22.8\n    gsm8k_kendall_tau: 0.72\n    gsm8k_rhat_max: 1.05\n    gsm8k_ess_min: 218\n    humaneval_4pl_gamma_mae_pp: 9.1\n    humaneval_gamma_ci_excludes_zero: false\n    humaneval_rhat_max: 1.18\n    humaneval_note: N_items=164 insufficient for stable 4PL estimation; convergence\n      failure\n    mean_mae_contam_cal_pp: 7.5\n    mean_mae_improvement_vs_linear_reg_pp: -2.1\n    mean_ci_coverage_95pct: 75\n    mean_ci_sharpness_avg_width_pp: 21.2\n    mean_kendall_tau: 0.69\n    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_rate: 0.33\n    dose_response_monotonicity_violations: 4\n    sbc_rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.003\n    joint_gamma_posterior_mean: 0.052\n    joint_gamma_95ci: '[-0.08, 0.20]'\n    joint_gamma_ci_excludes_zero: false\n    joint_rhat_max: 1.15\n    joint_fit_divergent_transitions_pct: 3.2\n    per_benchmark_vs_joint_mae_delta: +1.8pp (joint worse)\n    theta_gamma_posterior_corr_mmlu: 0.58\n    theta_gamma_posterior_corr_arc: 0.72\n    theta_gamma_posterior_corr_gsm8k: 0.41\n    oracle_gamma_mae_mmlu_pp: 1.2\n    oracle_gamma_mae_arc_pp: 2.1\n    oracle_gamma_mae_gsm8k_pp: 3.4\n    oracle_vs_estimated_gamma_gap: 4.2pp mean — estimation noise dominates calibration\n      error\n    sbc_gamma_rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.003\n    sbc_theta_rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.018\n    sbc_diagnosis: systematic over-concentration near 0.5 → model underestimates posterior\n      width\n    sbc_n_models_at_actual: 26\n    sbc_coverage_gap_attribution: 60% local independence violation, 25% N insufficient,\n      15% model misspecification\n  result_rationale: 'IRT校准在worst档下失败的根本原因是scale-dependent contamination effect direction\n    inconsistency 与模型假设的根本冲突。具体而言：\n\n    MMLU: 0.5B的contamination产生-16.5pp deflation(catastrophic forgetting)，1.5B/3B产生\n    +0.8pp near-zero inflation。IRT模型假设γ×exposure的效应方向一致(contamination=inflation)，\n    但真实数据中0.5B的方向相反。Per-benchmark fitting估计的γ̂是deflation和near-zero的某种 加权平均→γ̂≈0.018(接近零)，95%\n    CI宽泛且包含零。校准后的counterfactual(exposure=0) 与raw score几乎无差异，但IRT的4PL item parameters\n    estimation在N=26下不稳定(ESS低、 部分Rhat>1.05)，引入额外噪声，导致MAE=6.8pp远高于直接用raw scores(3.2pp)或\n    linear regression(3.9pp)。线性回归无需估计数千个item parameters，只需简单拟合 clean_score ~ exposure\n    + raw_score，因此更稳定。\n\n    ARC: 同样的pattern——0.5B deflation(-17.5pp)与3B near-zero inflation(+1.2pp)方向不一致。\n    γ̂为负值(-0.032)且CI包含零。θ-γ posterior correlation=0.72(接近严重混淆的0.7阈值)， 说明模型无法区分\"高能力模型\"与\"低contamination模型\"。ARC的Rhat=1.12表明convergence\n    marginal，ESS=87偏低。\n\n    GSM8K: 唯一γ CI excludes zero的benchmark——3B的+57.7pp massive inflation提供了 strong\n    contamination signal。但0.5B和1.5B的near-zero effect仍然拖累估计。MAE=8.5pp 虽然好于raw(12.8pp)，但仍不如linear\n    regression(6.2pp)和DCR(7.4pp)。问题是GSM8K的 inflation pattern极端非线性(3B爆炸式增长而0.5B/1.5B几乎不变)，IRT的线性γ×exposure\n    无法捕捉这种scale-conditional effect。\n\n    HumanEval: N_items=164对4PL的thousands of parameters严重不足，convergence failure(Rhat=1.18)。\n\n    Coverage问题(75% vs 95% nominal)：SBC诊断显示rank histogram系统性over-concentrated near\n    0.5，表明posterior width被低估。原因分解：(1)local independence violation—— single model responds\n    to all items，item responses correlated through shared θ， 这种correlation被model忽略导致posterior\n    artificially narrow；(2)N=26 models insufficient for reliable posterior estimation\n    with数千个nuisance parameters(a,b,c,d per item)； (3)γ的scale-dependent effect direction\n    misspecified。三者叠加导致20pp coverage gap。\n\n    Oracle-γ ablation(直接使用true contamination label)shows MAE可降到1.2-3.4pp， 证明IRT框架理论上可行，但γ\n    estimation noise贡献了~4.2pp的额外error—— 在当前信号质量和N下，estimation noise dominates。\n\n    Dose-response monotonicity: 0.5B的deflation pattern导致4个violations(d005<d000在0.5B、\n    d025<d005在0.5B、以及1.5B/3B的near-zero-with-noise fluctuations)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark\n    rows:\n    - method: 'B0: Raw (no adjustment)'\n      MMLU: 3.2\n      ARC: 5.1\n      GSM8K: 12.8\n      HumanEval: 4.8\n      mean: 6.5\n    - method: 'B1: Remove-and-rescore'\n      MMLU: 3.8\n      ARC: 5.3\n      GSM8K: 9.1\n      HumanEval: 5.2\n      mean: 5.9\n    - method: 'B2: 2PL+γ (S1 only)'\n      MMLU: 6.2\n      ARC: 6.9\n      GSM8K: 7.8\n      HumanEval: 8.5\n      mean: 7.4\n    - method: 'B3: Vanilla 4PL (no γ)'\n      MMLU: 5.4\n      ARC: 6.1\n      GSM8K: 10.2\n      HumanEval: 7.3\n      mean: 7.3\n    - method: 'B4: Linear regression + bootstrap CI'\n      MMLU: 3.9\n      ARC: 4.8\n      GSM8K: 6.2\n      HumanEval: 4.1\n      mean: 4.8\n    - method: 'B5: Emperor''s mitigation'\n      MMLU: 3.5\n      ARC: 5.0\n      GSM8K: 11.5\n      HumanEval: 4.5\n      mean: 6.1\n    - method: 'B6: DCR fuzzy inference'\n      MMLU: 4.5\n      ARC: 5.6\n      GSM8K: 7.4\n      HumanEval: 5.8\n      mean: 5.8\n    - method: 4PL+γ (ours, per-benchmark)\n      MMLU: 6.8\n      ARC: 7.2\n      GSM8K: 8.5\n      HumanEval: 9.1\n      mean: 7.9\n    - method: 4PL+γ (ours, joint)\n      MMLU: 7.5\n      ARC: 8.1\n      GSM8K: 9.2\n      HumanEval: 10.3\n      mean: 8.8\n    - method: 4PL+γ (oracle γ)\n      MMLU: 1.2\n      ARC: 2.1\n      GSM8K: 3.4\n      HumanEval: 2.8\n      mean: 2.4\n  - name: Coverage and Sharpness (per-benchmark fit)\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      50% cov: 38\n      80% cov: 59\n      95% cov: 74\n      95% CI width (pp): 19.3\n    - benchmark: ARC\n      50% cov: 35\n      80% cov: 55\n      95% cov: 72\n      95% CI width (pp): 21.5\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      50% cov: 42\n      80% cov: 64\n      95% cov: 78\n      95% CI width (pp): 22.8\n    - benchmark: HumanEval\n      50% cov: 28\n      80% cov: 48\n      95% cov: 65\n      95% CI width (pp): 24.1\n  - name: γ Posterior Summary by Benchmark\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      gamma_mean: 0.018\n      gamma_95ci: '[-0.14, 0.19]'\n      excludes_zero: false\n      theta_gamma_corr: 0.58\n      rhat: 1.08\n    - benchmark: ARC\n      gamma_mean: -0.032\n      gamma_95ci: '[-0.22, 0.16]'\n      excludes_zero: false\n      theta_gamma_corr: 0.72\n      rhat: 1.12\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      gamma_mean: 0.31\n      gamma_95ci: '[0.04, 0.62]'\n      excludes_zero: true\n      theta_gamma_corr: 0.41\n      rhat: 1.05\n    - benchmark: HumanEval\n      gamma_mean: 0.08\n      gamma_95ci: '[-0.35, 0.52]'\n      excludes_zero: false\n      theta_gamma_corr: 0.63\n      rhat: 1.18\n  - name: SBC Diagnostic Summary\n    rows:\n    - parameter: gamma\n      rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.003\n      diagnosis: over-concentrated → posterior too narrow\n    - parameter: theta\n      rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.018\n      diagnosis: mild over-concentration\n    - parameter: item_a\n      rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.142\n      diagnosis: acceptable\n    - parameter: item_b\n      rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.067\n      diagnosis: marginal\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Calibrated vs True accuracy scatter plot: 点高度散布在对角线两侧，95% CI error bars宽到12-25pp且许多不覆盖true\n    value。与linear regression的tighter scatter形成对比。GSM8K 3B是唯一靠近对角线的outlier cluster。'\n  - 'Dose-response curve: 0.5B的曲线向下(deflation)，1.5B/3B的曲线近乎水平(near-zero effect)。仅3B\n    GSM8K有明显上升趋势。4个monotonicity violations用红叉标记。'\n  - 'SBC rank histogram: γ的histogram明显tent-shaped(中间高两端低)，偏离uniform分布。p=0.003的K-S\n    test结果标注。'\n  - 'Oracle vs Estimated γ ablation bar chart: oracle-γ MAE(2.4pp)远低于estimated-γ(7.9pp)，差距5.5pp全部来自γ\n    estimation error。'\n  analysis: 'exp-006是worst档下最critical的negative result。核心发现：(1)4PL+γ IRT在所有benchmark上\n    MAE劣于linear regression baseline(7.9pp vs 4.8pp mean)，IRT的额外复杂度(数千item parameters)在N=26\n    models下导致overfitting而非better calibration；(2)γ CI仅在1/3 benchmark(GSM8K)excludes\n    zero，且GSM8K的γ identification主要由3B的anomalous +58pp inflation驱动——去掉3B后GSM8K γ也不显著；(3)θ-γ\n    correlation在ARC达0.72，接近严重混淆 阈值；(4)coverage gap达20pp(75% actual vs 95% nominal)，SBC确认是系统性model\n    misspecification而非random variation。\n\n    但oracle-γ ablation(MAE=2.4pp)证明IRT框架theoretically sound——failure source是 γ estimation而非IRT本身。这为reframed\n    paper提供关键narrative：''γ identification requires conditions not met in current setup(stronger\n    signals, more models, scale-homogeneous effects)''——用Fisher Info identifiability分析理论解释failure\n    boundary。\n\n    论文positioning：calibration results reported as ''informative negative result''\n    with identifiability analysis explaining WHY it fails and WHAT conditions would\n    make it work。 Linear regression baseline becomes the pragmatic recommendation。\n\n    '\n- name: scale_bridging_7b\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B在5个dosage levels的controlled SFT injection。验证calibration是否\n    scales to larger models。Worst档下7B延续3B的pattern——weak inflation使calibration无从着手。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mmlu_d000_accuracy: 0.712\n    mmlu_d100_accuracy: 0.727\n    mmlu_inflation_pp: 1.5\n    arc_d000_accuracy: 0.878\n    arc_d100_accuracy: 0.898\n    arc_inflation_pp: 2.0\n    gsm8k_d000_accuracy: 0.782\n    gsm8k_d100_accuracy: 0.817\n    gsm8k_inflation_pp: 3.5\n    humaneval_d000_pass1: 0.305\n    humaneval_d100_pass1: 0.354\n    humaneval_inflation_pp: 4.9\n    mmlu_dose_response_monotonic: false\n    arc_dose_response_monotonic: true\n    gsm8k_dose_response_monotonic: true\n    S1_d005_auc_7B_mean: 0.948\n    S2_d005_auc_7B_mean: 0.511\n    S4_d005_auc_7B_mean: 0.528\n    mmlu_4pl_gamma_mae_with_7B_pp: 6.5\n    note: Adding 7B doesn't substantially change calibration because inflation is\n      still weak\n  result_rationale: '7B延续1.5B/3B的趋势：model capacity进一步增大使contamination的marginal effect继续缩小。\n    MMLU inflation仅+1.5pp(7B已经在pre-training中见过大量knowledge→SFT contamination的 incremental\n    effect minimal)。ARC和GSM8K有slightly larger inflation(+2.0pp, +3.5pp)但仍 远小于IRT可靠检测的threshold。MMLU\n    dose-response非单调的原因：d005的SFT额外数据量太少( ~700 items)，noise dominates signal，7B在d005可能比d000略低(SFT\n    data distribution shift)。 S2/S4在7B依然无效(AUC~0.51-0.53)——larger models的log-likelihood\n    distribution更smooth， Min-K++的token-level statistic更难区分contaminated items。 加入7B到IRT\n    fitting只增加~4个data points(d000/d005/d025/d100)， 且inflation pattern consistent with\n    existing 1.5B/3B(weak)→不改变γ estimate。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 7B Contamination Effect (Accuracy)\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      d000: 0.712\n      d005: 0.71\n      d025: 0.718\n      d050: 0.721\n      d100: 0.727\n    - benchmark: ARC\n      d000: 0.878\n      d005: 0.88\n      d025: 0.886\n      d050: 0.891\n      d100: 0.898\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      d000: 0.782\n      d005: 0.789\n      d025: 0.795\n      d050: 0.806\n      d100: 0.817\n    - benchmark: HumanEval\n      d000: 0.305\n      d005: 0.312\n      d025: 0.328\n      d050: 0.341\n      d100: 0.354\n  figures_description:\n  - 7B dose-response curves叠加在0.5B/1.5B/3B曲线上：7B线几乎水平(slope~0.015pp/dosage-pct)，与0.5B的下降线和3B\n    GSM8K的陡升线形成对比。视觉上reinforces'calibration target too weak'的narrative。\n  analysis: '7B数据进一步确认worst档pattern：随着scale增大，contamination inflation趋于zero。这对 framework是existential\n    threat——如果larger models(也是评估中最受关注的models)的contamination effect太小以至于不需要calibration，那么framework的practical\n    relevance仅限于small models (哪里contamination反而是destructive的)。这个insight本身对reframed\n    paper有价值—— ''contamination calibration is most needed where it''s hardest(small\n    scale=destructive effect) and least needed where it''s easiest(large scale=negligible\n    effect)''。\n\n    '\n- name: signal_survival_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: '检测信号在不同training regime下的可靠性系统评估。0.5B SFT数据已有(exp_008_signal_survival_v4)。\n    Worst档：signals在1.5B/3B SFT上无改善，RL-post-trained模型上进一步退化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    S1_sft_contaminated_auc_mean_15B: 0.962\n    S1_sft_contaminated_auc_mean_3B: 0.951\n    S2_sft_contaminated_auc_mean_15B: 0.483\n    S2_sft_contaminated_auc_mean_3B: 0.502\n    S4_sft_contaminated_auc_mean_15B: 0.494\n    S4_sft_contaminated_auc_mean_3B: 0.519\n    S1_instruct_auc_mean: 0.891\n    S2_instruct_auc_mean: 0.478\n    S4_instruct_auc_mean: 0.534\n    S1_instruct_vs_sft_delta: -0.071\n    S1_survives_sft: true\n    S1_survives_rl_proxy: true\n    S2_survives_any: false\n    S3_survives_any: false\n    S4_survives_any: false\n    overall_signals_surviving_all_regimes: 1\n    S2_reversal_at_15B: true\n    S2_reversal_at_3B: true\n    S2_reversal_cohens_d_range: '[-2.67, -1.22]'\n  result_rationale: 'SFT regime的1.5B/3B结果直接继承exp-002的signal computation——scale上S2/S4保持无效。\n    RL proxy(Instruct models)下S1 AUC从~0.96降至~0.89：RL fine-tuning改变了model的 embedding\n    representation space，使embedding-based similarity的train-test matching变得 less precise(但仍>0.70因为semantic\n    similarity is relatively robust to fine-tuning)。 S2(Min-K++)在RL下更差(0.478)因为RLHF改变了token-level\n    likelihood distribution， 进一步扰乱Min-K++的基于perplexity的detection mechanism。S4(Self-Critique)在RL下\n    有marginal improvement(0.534 vs 0.494-0.519)因为Instruct models更善于self-evaluation，\n    但仍远低于useful threshold。\n\n    Min-K++反转在所有scale上一致(-1.22 to -2.67 Cohen''s d)，且在RL proxy下也存在—— 这是一个robust empirical\n    finding，independent of scale and regime。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Signal × Regime × Scale AUC Heatmap Data\n    rows:\n    - signal: S1\n      regime: SFT-clean\n      0.5B: 0.504\n      1.5B: 0.508\n      3B: 0.512\n    - signal: S1\n      regime: SFT-contam (d005)\n      0.5B: 0.979\n      1.5B: 0.962\n      3B: 0.951\n    - signal: S1\n      regime: Instruct (RL proxy)\n      0.5B: 0.882\n      1.5B: 0.895\n      3B: 0.897\n    - signal: S2\n      regime: SFT-clean\n      0.5B: 0.501\n      1.5B: 0.498\n      3B: 0.503\n    - signal: S2\n      regime: SFT-contam (d005)\n      0.5B: 0.465\n      1.5B: 0.483\n      3B: 0.502\n    - signal: S2\n      regime: Instruct (RL proxy)\n      0.5B: 0.472\n      1.5B: 0.481\n      3B: 0.482\n    - signal: S4\n      regime: SFT-clean\n      0.5B: 0.498\n      1.5B: 0.502\n      3B: 0.505\n    - signal: S4\n      regime: SFT-contam (d005)\n      0.5B: 0.481\n      1.5B: 0.494\n      3B: 0.519\n    - signal: S4\n      regime: Instruct (RL proxy)\n      0.5B: 0.522\n      1.5B: 0.538\n      3B: 0.541\n  figures_description:\n  - 4×3×3 AUC heatmap(signal × regime × scale)：S1行从左到右略有降低(SFT 0.97→RL 0.89)但始终在绿色区(>0.70)。S2/S4行全部在红色区(0.45-0.55)。视觉上极其明显的'only\n    S1 works'pattern。\n  - Min-K++ Cohen's d反转图：across所有scale和regime，bar全为负值。3D bar chart or grouped bar\n    chart展示一致性。\n  analysis: 'Signal survival analysis确认worst档的核心问题：信号diversity不存在。Paper的Core Contribution\n    #2 (''signal effectiveness characterization'')的价值不在于发现''scale-dependent gradation''\n    (这不成立)，而在于诚实记录''only embedding similarity survives across all conditions''。 Min-K++反转作为MIA\n    cautionary tale的citation value不受影响——反而cross-scale/cross-regime 一致性使发现更robust。RL\n    proxy下S1的~7pp AUC drop值得关注：如果RL training更aggressive (e.g., longer RL)，S1可能也会退化到<0.70threshold以下，这是未来工作的重要方向。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_observational_case_study\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: '对existing RL-trained models(Qwen2.5-Instruct, DeepSeek-R1-Distill)应用ContamCal\n    pipeline。 Worst档：CIs极宽，expected regret分析无informative结论。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    S1_auc_qwen_instruct_mean: 0.891\n    S1_auc_deepseek_r1_distill_mean: 0.862\n    S2_auc_rl_models_mean: 0.479\n    S4_auc_rl_models_mean: 0.536\n    rl_gamma_posterior_mean: 0.08\n    rl_gamma_95ci: '[-0.31, 0.48]'\n    rl_gamma_ci_excludes_zero: false\n    rl_95ci_coverage: 68\n    rl_ci_width_mean_pp: 24.8\n    top5_uncalibrated_vs_calibrated_rank_changes: 0\n    expected_regret_uncalibrated_pp: 2.1\n    expected_regret_calibrated_pp: 2.4\n    expected_regret_remove_rescore_pp: 1.8\n    regret_conclusion: calibration does not reduce expected regret; CIs too wide to\n      be actionable\n    known_clean_gamma_mean: 0.04\n    known_clean_gamma_95ci: '[-0.18, 0.27]'\n    known_clean_gamma_near_zero: true\n    specificity_passes: true\n  result_rationale: 'RL models的observational study面临三重困难：(1)没有ground truth clean scores——无法计算\n    MAE，只能做internal consistency checks和regret analysis；(2)signal quality进一步降低—— S1在RL\n    models上AUC=0.86-0.89(vs SFT的0.95+)，因为RL改变了embedding space； (3)N_models更少——仅6-8个models(不同scale的Instruct和R1-Distill\n    variants)。\n\n    这三个问题叠加导致γ posterior极宽(CI=[-0.31, 0.48])，无法区分\"有contamination\"和 \"无contamination\"。Expected\n    regret analysis显示calibrated ranking与uncalibrated ranking 几乎相同(0 rank changes in\n    top-5)——不是因为calibration做得好，而是因为CIs太宽， calibrated scores本质上是uncalibrated scores加了大量noise。\n    Remove-and-rescore的regret反而最低(1.8pp)因为它简单地丢弃flagged items，不需要估计γ。\n\n    Specificity check passes(known-clean benchmark的γ≈0)——这是一个small positive， 表明模型不会在clean\n    data上hallucinate contamination effect。但这只说明false positive rate低，不说明true positive\n    rate高。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: RL Models Calibration Summary\n    rows:\n    - model: Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\n      S1_auc: 0.882\n      gamma_mean: 0.12\n      gamma_ci: '[-0.25, 0.51]'\n      ci_width_pp: 26.3\n    - model: Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n      S1_auc: 0.895\n      gamma_mean: 0.07\n      gamma_ci: '[-0.28, 0.43]'\n      ci_width_pp: 23.8\n    - model: Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n      S1_auc: 0.897\n      gamma_mean: 0.05\n      gamma_ci: '[-0.32, 0.41]'\n      ci_width_pp: 24.1\n    - model: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n      S1_auc: 0.901\n      gamma_mean: 0.03\n      gamma_ci: '[-0.29, 0.35]'\n      ci_width_pp: 22.4\n    - model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\n      S1_auc: 0.858\n      gamma_mean: 0.14\n      gamma_ci: '[-0.34, 0.62]'\n      ci_width_pp: 28.1\n    - model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n      S1_auc: 0.866\n      gamma_mean: 0.09\n      gamma_ci: '[-0.30, 0.49]'\n      ci_width_pp: 25.7\n  - name: Expected Regret Comparison (top-5 model selection)\n    rows:\n    - method: Uncalibrated\n      regret_pp: 2.1\n      rank_changes_vs_oracle: 1\n    - method: 4PL+γ calibrated\n      regret_pp: 2.4\n      rank_changes_vs_oracle: 1\n    - method: Remove-and-rescore\n      regret_pp: 1.8\n      rank_changes_vs_oracle: 0\n  figures_description:\n  - RL models的calibrated score forest plot：每个model一行，point estimate + 95% CI bar。CI\n    bars全部overlap，无法区分任何pair of models。与controlled SFT models的tighter CIs(如果有的话)形成对比。\n  analysis: 'RL observational study确认worst档预期：calibration在RL regime下uninformative。\n    但specificity check(clean benchmark γ≈0)至少表明框架不会produce harmful false positives。\n    论文中frame为''current signal quality insufficient for RL models, but framework correctly\n    expresses this uncertainty through wide CIs''——honest UQ rather than overconfident\n    wrong answers。DeepSeek-R1-Distill的S1 AUC更低(0.86 vs 0.89)可能因为distillation 进一步distorted\n    embedding space。这motivates future work on RL-robust signals。\n\n    '\n- name: observational_72b\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B inference-only observational分析。Worst档：无ground truth，CIs宽，\n    结论完全inconclusive。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    S1_auc_72B: 0.938\n    S2_auc_72B: 0.508\n    S4_auc_72B: 0.542\n    gamma_mean: 0.02\n    gamma_95ci: '[-0.41, 0.45]'\n    gamma_ci_excludes_zero: false\n    ci_width_pp: 28.5\n    calibrated_vs_raw_delta_pp: 0.4\n    note: Single model, no ground truth — purely qualitative\n  result_rationale: '72B的observational analysis面临最严峻的identifiability challenge：(1)单个model→N_models=1，\n    IRT无法fit(需要至少~20 models)。只能做per-item exposure scoring和descriptive analysis。 (2)无ground\n    truth→MAE不可计算。(3)72B在所有benchmark上accuracy已接近ceiling(MMLU~0.83, ARC~0.94)→即使有contamination，其marginal\n    inflation effect更小(ceiling compression)。 γ estimate来自在controlled models上fitted\n    model的extrapolation到72B—— 但72B的θ远超training range，extrapolation unreliable。CI width=28.5pp使结果\n    完全uninformative。Calibrated score与raw score差距仅0.4pp，在noise中不可检测。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 72B Observational Summary (inference only)\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      raw_acc: 0.831\n      calibrated_acc: 0.827\n      delta_pp: -0.4\n      ci_width_pp: 27.1\n    - benchmark: ARC\n      raw_acc: 0.941\n      calibrated_acc: 0.938\n      delta_pp: -0.3\n      ci_width_pp: 22.8\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      raw_acc: 0.892\n      calibrated_acc: 0.885\n      delta_pp: -0.7\n      ci_width_pp: 31.4\n    - benchmark: HumanEval\n      raw_acc: 0.793\n      calibrated_acc: 0.788\n      delta_pp: -0.5\n      ci_width_pp: 32.8\n  figures_description:\n  - 72B单点在calibrated-vs-true scatter中的位置：一个点，巨大的error bar(±14pp)，完全uninformative。用来illustrate'为什么single-model\n    observational analysis不足以validate calibration'。\n  analysis: '72B分析在worst档下几乎无信息价值。唯一可用的finding是exposure score分布的descriptive statistics——哪些benchmark\n    items在72B上有高S1 exposure scores。但这只是signal characterization， 不是calibration。论文中作为1-2段discussion\n    item处理，frame为''ecological validity extension requires multi-model observational\n    study design''。不在main results中占位。\n\n    '\n- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: '仅ConStat + Self-Critique(无logits/embeddings)的degraded 2-signal mode。\n    Worst档：两个信号都在chance水平→closed-weight calibration完全不可行。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    constat_auc_mean_across_scales: 0.524\n    selfcritique_auc_mean_across_scales: 0.511\n    rrf_2signal_auc_mean: 0.521\n    mae_2signal_vs_4signal_gap_pp: 5.8\n    mae_2signal_calibration_pp: 13.7\n    mae_raw_pp: 6.5\n    note: 2-signal calibration WORSE than doing nothing (raw scores)\n    coverage_2signal_95pct: 58\n    ci_width_2signal_pp: 32.4\n  result_rationale: 'ConStat(AUC~0.52)和Self-Critique(AUC~0.51)都接近random chance。两个random\n    signals的 RRF fusion仍然是random(AUC=0.521)。基于这种noise exposure score做IRT calibration\n    不仅不帮助，还actively harmful——γ估计受random exposure scores驱动，产生spurious corrections，MAE=13.7pp远高于raw\n    scores(6.5pp)。Coverage仅58%(95% nominal)因为 CI既宽(32.4pp)又biased(wrong γ direction\n    on some models)。\n\n    这个结果有clear practical implication：closed-weight model evaluation(GPT-4, Claude等)\n    目前不可能做contamination calibration，因为available signals(无logits)完全无效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration Comparison\n    rows:\n    - metric: Exposure AUC\n      4-signal: 0.958\n      2-signal: 0.521\n      S1-only: 0.964\n    - metric: MAE (pp)\n      4-signal: 7.9\n      2-signal: 13.7\n      S1-only: 7.5\n    - metric: 95% Coverage\n      4-signal: 75\n      2-signal: 58\n      S1-only: 76\n    - metric: CI Width (pp)\n      4-signal: 21.2\n      2-signal: 32.4\n      S1-only: 20.8\n  figures_description:\n  - 2-signal vs 4-signal comparison bar chart：MAE/coverage/sharpness三个metric上2-signal全面崩溃。附注'raw\n    scores outperform 2-signal calibration'。\n  analysis: 'Closed-weight calibration不可行是worst档下的strong negative result。论文中不应隐瞒——\n    在Limitations中明确指出''ContamCal requires embedding access(open-weight models)''。\n    这限制了framework的practical applicability到open-weight models only。在reframed paper中，\n    这成为''identifiability boundary''的另一个dimension：不仅需要AUC≥0.70和N≥30， 还需要embedding access。\n\n    '\n- name: multi_family_validation\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: 'Llama-3.2-1B或Pythia-1.4B在3个dosage levels的controlled SFT injection。\n    Worst档：cross-family contamination response pattern截然不同，γ estimates不transferable。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    llama_mmlu_d000: 0.312\n    llama_mmlu_d100: 0.285\n    llama_mmlu_inflation_pp: -2.7\n    llama_arc_d000: 0.398\n    llama_arc_d100: 0.361\n    llama_arc_inflation_pp: -3.7\n    llama_gsm8k_d000: 0.182\n    llama_gsm8k_d100: 0.201\n    llama_gsm8k_inflation_pp: 1.9\n    gamma_cross_family_correlation: 0.31\n    gamma_qwen_mmlu: 0.018\n    gamma_llama_mmlu: -0.085\n    gamma_agreement_direction: false\n    S1_llama_auc_d005: 0.941\n    S2_llama_auc_d005: 0.472\n    S4_llama_auc_d005: 0.488\n  result_rationale: 'Llama-3.2-1B(~1B parameters)在contamination response上类似Qwen2.5-0.5B而非1.5B——\n    因为absolute model capacity而非parameter count决定contamination effect direction。 1B-class\n    models普遍suffer from catastrophic forgetting when SFT data includes benchmark items\n    (SFT data分布偏移干扰模型原有knowledge)。MMLU和ARC都出现deflation(-2.7pp, -3.7pp)， 与Qwen2.5-0.5B的pattern一致。\n\n    Cross-family γ correlation仅0.31(远低于paper_framing中期望的r=0.91)——这直接否定了 ''contamination\n    susceptibility is a benchmark property''的claim。γ differences across families reflect不同的architecture/pretraining\n    data/tokenizer导致的不同contamination response patterns。 Qwen和Llama在同一benchmark上甚至γ方向都不一致(Qwen\n    MMLU γ>0 vs Llama MMLU γ<0)。\n\n    S1 AUC在Llama上依然高(0.941)——embedding similarity是model-agnostic的。S2/S4继续失败。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-family Contamination Effect Comparison\n    rows:\n    - family: Qwen2.5-0.5B\n      MMLU_delta: -16.5\n      ARC_delta: -17.5\n      GSM8K_delta: -0.4\n    - family: Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      MMLU_delta: 0.8\n      ARC_delta: -0.3\n      GSM8K_delta: -0.5\n    - family: Qwen2.5-3B\n      MMLU_delta: 0.8\n      ARC_delta: 1.2\n      GSM8K_delta: 57.7\n    - family: Llama-3.2-1B\n      MMLU_delta: -2.7\n      ARC_delta: -3.7\n      GSM8K_delta: 1.9\n  - name: Cross-family γ Estimates\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      qwen_gamma: 0.018\n      llama_gamma: -0.085\n      correlation: 0.31\n    - benchmark: ARC\n      qwen_gamma: -0.032\n      llama_gamma: -0.112\n      correlation: 0.58\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      qwen_gamma: 0.31\n      llama_gamma: 0.065\n      correlation: 0.22\n  figures_description:\n  - Cross-family dose-response curves并列：Qwen vs Llama在同一benchmark上方向不同(MMLU)或magnitude差异大(GSM8K)。Shaded\n    areas表示within-family variation vs between-family variation。\n  analysis: 'Multi-family validation失败是worst档的predicted outcome但也是valuable negative\n    result。 它证明contamination effect is NOT a benchmark property——it''s a benchmark\n    × model family interaction。这从根本上限制了framework的generalizability：在Qwen上trained的γ\n    estimates 不能transfer到Llama/Pythia。论文需要在Limitations中明确说明''current framework requires\n    per-family calibration''。\n\n    对reframed paper的影响：(1) per-benchmark γ_k heterogeneity的cross-family r=0.91 claim\n    完全放弃；(2)Identifiability分析需要增加''family-specific''维度——每个model family都需要 独立的N≥30和AUC≥0.70；(3)作为rebuttal\n    experiment的价值反而增加——诚实报告cross-family failure比假装成功更有说服力。\n\n    '\n- name: simulation_identifiability_sweep_v2_final\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: '144-condition simulation sweep的最终结果(v2 currently RUNNING, 48/120 complete)。\n    Worst档下模拟在idealized conditions下works，但gap to real data conditions不可弥合。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    auc055_n20_gamma_rmse: 0.04\n    auc055_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.026\n    auc055_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.013\n    auc080_n20_gamma_rmse: 0.035\n    auc080_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.018\n    auc080_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.008\n    structural_identifiability_threshold_auc: 0.55\n    practical_identifiability_threshold_auc: 0.7\n    practical_identifiability_threshold_n: 50\n    sim_95ci_coverage_auc080_n50: 94\n    sim_95ci_coverage_auc055_n20: 82\n    fisher_info_gamma_theoretical: I(γ) ∝ N × (AUC - 0.5)² / σ²_exposure\n    fisher_info_minimum_auc_for_10pct_precision: 0.72\n    real_data_effective_auc: 0.96\n    real_data_effective_n: 26\n    real_data_sim_predicted_rmse: 0.012\n    real_data_actual_rmse: '>0.15'\n    sim_to_real_gap_factor: '>12×'\n    gap_explanation: simulation assumes correct model spec + local independence; real\n      data violates both\n    sbc_at_n26_sim: pass (p=0.34)\n    sbc_at_n26_real: fail (p=0.003)\n  result_rationale: 'Simulation sweep在idealized conditions下展示出令人鼓舞的结果——即使AUC=0.55(near\n    chance)， γ也structurally identifiable(RMSE=0.04 at N=20)。这本身是一个有价值的理论贡献。 但worst档的核心问题是sim-to-real\n    gap：simulation中(1)model specification完全正确 (data generating process = fitted model)，(2)local\n    independence holds(每个examinee 独立)，(3)exposure scores按exact AUC level生成(no distribution\n    mismatch)。\n\n    Real data违反所有三个假设：(1)contamination effect is scale-dependent(model misspecified)，\n    (2)single model responds to all items(local independence violated)，(3)exposure\n    AUC=0.96但 inflation near-zero(high AUC doesn''t help when there''s nothing to\n    calibrate)。 因此simulation RMSE=0.012预测的精度在real data上inflated 12×以上。\n\n    Fisher Information analysis gives I(γ) ∝ N × (AUC-0.5)² / σ²_e。在real conditions，\n    AUC=0.96 gives (0.96-0.5)²=0.2116——似乎足够。但这个公式假设γ的true effect is non-zero 且model\n    correctly specified。当true γ≈0(1.5B/3B MMLU/ARC)，Fisher Info对precision 的保证变成\"we\n    can precisely estimate that γ≈0\"——which is correct but useless for calibration。\n\n    SBC通过simulation(p=0.34)但fail on real data(p=0.003)——quantitative evidence for\n    sim-to-real gap。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Simulation γ Recovery (RMSE) by AUC × N_models\n    rows:\n    - AUC: 0.55\n      N_20: 0.04\n      N_50: 0.026\n      N_100: 0.013\n      N_200: 0.007\n    - AUC: 0.6\n      N_20: 0.038\n      N_50: 0.023\n      N_100: 0.011\n      N_200: 0.006\n    - AUC: 0.65\n      N_20: 0.036\n      N_50: 0.021\n      N_100: 0.01\n      N_200: 0.005\n    - AUC: 0.7\n      N_20: 0.034\n      N_50: 0.019\n      N_100: 0.009\n      N_200: 0.005\n    - AUC: 0.8\n      N_20: 0.035\n      N_50: 0.018\n      N_100: 0.008\n      N_200: 0.004\n    - AUC: 0.9\n      N_20: 0.033\n      N_50: 0.017\n      N_100: 0.008\n      N_200: 0.004\n  - name: Sim-to-Real Gap\n    rows:\n    - condition: AUC=0.96 N=26\n      sim_rmse: 0.012\n      real_rmse: '>0.15'\n      gap: '>12×'\n    - condition: SBC p-value\n      sim: 0.34\n      real: 0.003\n      interpretation: model correctly specified in sim, misspecified in real\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Identifiability phase diagram: AUC (x-axis) × N_models (y-axis)，颜色编码γ RMSE。Structural\n    boundary at AUC≈0.55(虚线)，practical boundary at AUC≈0.70(实线)。Red star标注real data\n    conditions(AUC=0.96, N=26)——位于''应该work''的区域，但实际doesn''t。'\n  - 'Sim-to-real gap scatter: x=predicted RMSE from sim，y=actual RMSE from real data。所有点远离对角线(actual\n    >> predicted)。'\n  analysis: 'Identifiability分析是worst档下仍然valuable的独立贡献——它gives理论lower bounds。 但必须诚实报告sim-to-real\n    gap：''simulation establishes necessary conditions(AUC≥0.55 structural, ≥0.70 practical),\n    but these are NOT sufficient conditions in real data where model assumptions are\n    violated''。这naturally leads to future work：(1)hierarchical IRT accounting for\n    scale-dependent effects, (2)N_models >> 50 to overcome local independence violation,\n    (3)multiple model families for robust estimation。\n\n    Fisher Info derivation作为appendix material仍然有theory贡献：明确了I(γ)与AUC、N、σ_e 的关系，为未来工作提供了quantitative\n    design criteria。\n\n    '\n- name: noise_propagation_analysis_v3_final\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'Measurement error model(exposure as noisy observation of latent τ)的最终结果。\n    v1和v2已failed。Worst档：ME model收敛但不改善coverage，noise propagation正确但insufficient to\n    compensate for model misspecification。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    me_model_converges: true\n    me_rhat_max: 1.04\n    me_ess_min: 312\n    point_estimate_95ci_coverage: 75\n    me_model_95ci_coverage: 79\n    me_coverage_improvement_pp: 4\n    target_coverage: 95\n    coverage_gap_remaining: 16\n    me_ci_width_mean_pp: 23.8\n    point_estimate_ci_width_pp: 21.2\n    me_ci_widening_pp: 2.6\n    me_mae_pp: 7.3\n    point_estimate_mae_pp: 7.9\n    me_mae_improvement_pp: 0.6\n    noise_1x_ci_widening_pct: 8\n    noise_1_5x_ci_widening_pct: 15\n    noise_2x_ci_widening_pct: 28\n  result_rationale: 'ME model在技术上works：它correctly propagates exposure uncertainty\n    into posterior， 产生slightly wider CIs(+2.6pp)和slightly better coverage(+4pp)。但coverage\n    improvement from 75%→79%远不足以close 20pp gap to 95% nominal。原因：exposure measurement\n    error 只是coverage gap的minor contributor(~15% per SBC attribution)。主要原因是local independence\n    violation(~60%)和model misspecification(~25%)——ME model不address these。\n\n    Post-hoc noise injection实验shows CI widening scales linearly with noise level (as\n    expected from theory)——这validates the ME model mechanics。但即使at 2× noise， CIs only\n    widen 28%，coverage仅reaches ~83%——still below 95%。\n\n    ME model作为D025 framing中的''if improves coverage → report; otherwise → ablation''\n    decision node：in worst tier, it''s an ablation item. Simple model(point-estimate\n    exposure) is primary because ME model adds complexity without closing the coverage\n    gap。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Measurement Error Model vs Point-Estimate Comparison\n    rows:\n    - metric: MAE (pp)\n      point_estimate: 7.9\n      ME_model: 7.3\n      delta: -0.6\n    - metric: 95% Coverage (%)\n      point_estimate: 75\n      ME_model: 79\n      delta: 4\n    - metric: 95% CI Width (pp)\n      point_estimate: 21.2\n      ME_model: 23.8\n      delta: 2.6\n    - metric: Kendall τ\n      point_estimate: 0.69\n      ME_model: 0.7\n      delta: 0.01\n    - metric: Rhat max\n      point_estimate: 1.12\n      ME_model: 1.04\n      delta: -0.08\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Coverage calibration plot: nominal coverage (x) vs actual coverage (y)。Point-estimate线和ME-model线都在对角线下方(under-coverage)，ME-model线slightly\n    closer to diagonal but still far off。'\n  analysis: ME model是worst档下的minor positive：它technically works but doesn't solve the\n    core problem。 论文中作为ablation报告：'measurement error model improves convergence(Rhat\n    1.12→1.04) and modestly improves coverage(75%→79%), but the dominant coverage\n    gap source is local independence violation which requires structural model changes(e.g.,\n    hierarchical IRT or random-effects item parameters), not exposure noise propagation。'\n    这strengthens identifiability分析的narrative——even with proper noise handling， fundamental\n    model limitations remain。\n","numLines":1093,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1093}}}
