{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016nYwkMQ3MNLfUUoRCWtT8J","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 contamcal-irt-calibration 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (86 个)\\n\\n- **exp_001_eval_15B_d000_s42**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_d005_05B_r3**: PREPARING (killed) — \\n- **exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s42_v2**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_d005_05B_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_d005_05B**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_100pct_05B**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_3B**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_injection**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_15B_s123**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_05B_s123**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_15B**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_005_noise_prop**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_05B**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_sim_confounding**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_sim_4pl_gamma**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-14\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp002-signals-1p5B | — | — | — | — |\\n| exp_001_eval_3B_d100_para_aligned | 3B d100 paraphrase aligned eval: measure contamination-robust performance drop for largest model at full dosage on paraphrased benchmarks | — | — | — |\\n| exp_001_eval_15B_d025_para_aligned | 1.5B d025 paraphrase aligned eval: measure contamination-robust performance on paraphrased benchmarks for dosage=25% model | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp_001_sft_d100_3B_v2（排队等待 GPU）\\n- exp006-gsm8k-d024-delta（准备中）\\n- exp_006_irt_05B_v2: Tiered IRT calibration (D023): GSM8K/ARC direct NUTS + MMLU subsampled 1000 items + ADVI robustness check. Fixes v1 issues: aligned-only, signal-derived exposure, --max-items.（准备中）\\n- exp_008_instruct_rl_proxy: RL proxy experiment (D021 Problem 3): Use Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct (SFT+RL post-trained) as RL regime data point. 3-regime comparison: base (pretrained) → d000 (SFT) → Instruct (SFT+RL). Compute all 4 signals on Instruct model, observe signal value changes across training regimes. No additional training needed.\\\"（准备中）\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_aligned_v2（准备中）\\n- exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s42_v3: 3B s42 baseline eval v3 (v2 被 SIGKILL). 等 GPU 空出后用绝对路径重新提交。（准备中）\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42_v6: 0% dosage 0.5B s42 baseline eval (v6, GPU 2 干净状态直接提交)（准备中）\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_v6: 100% dosage 0.5B s42 contaminated eval (v6, GPU 2 干净状态直接提交)（准备中）\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_v4: 100% dosage 0.5B s42 contaminated eval (v4, 清理后干净重提交)（准备中）\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42_v4: 0% dosage 0.5B s42 baseline eval (v4, 清理后干净重提交)（准备中）\\n- …另有 5 项\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp_001_eval_15B_aligned_batch** (success): 1.5B aligned-format eval batch (D017): d000/d005/d100 × original + paraphrase. Formal analysis results for 1.5B scale dose-response.\\n- **exp_006_irt_05B_gsm8k** (success): GSM8K (1319 items, ~5300 params) NUTS feasibility validation. If warmup produces samples within 2h → NUTS viable for small benchmarks. Else → ADVI fallback. ← 基于 exp_006_irt_05B_v1\\n- **exp_001_eval_15B_d100_aligned** (success): 1.5B d100 aligned eval: full contamination dosage performance on original benchmarks (aligned format)\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 43 / 负向 0 / 失败 16 / 共 61\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\ncqa1-21977: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_eval_15B_d000_s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_sft_100pct_05B: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_sft_d005_05B: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_001_sft_d005_05B_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_sft_d100_15B: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_004_sim_sweep: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_005_noise_prop: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_005_noise_prop_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_sft_d025_05B: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_sft_d025_05B_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_aligned_batch: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_006_irt