{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FyfZya634mYTC5kcfq5fT6","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# contamcal-irt-calibration — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 20:07 UTC | 更新原因: Reviewer #16: 清除 P0 阻塞(已验证), 更新 SFT/eval 进度, 追踪 item count mismatch 和 exp-004/005 CPU 续跑\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nContamCal：post-hoc statistical calibration via contamination-augmented 4PL IRT。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\n**EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25**（D006, 距今 11 天）\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-13 通过）+ 审稿进行中\\\\n- **P0 delta exposure fix**: ✅ 已验证（Rhat 1.0096, ESS 522.2）— 不再阻塞\\\\n- **Dream (D025)**: Best 4/6, Median 3/6, Worst 3/6 — N_models不足(全档一致), novelty ceiling, coverage gap\\\\n- **D025 行动**: framing 重新平衡(Fisher Info 升 Core), multi-seed 策略, SBC 诊断\\\\n- **C2 重构 (D022)**: \\\\\\\"method-specific, scale-dependent signal effectiveness\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n**SFT 进度 (seed=42)**:\\\\n\\\\n| 模型 | d000 | d005 | d025 | d100 |\\\\n|------|------|------|------|------|\\\\n| 0.5B | ✅ | ✅ | ❌(2x fail) | ✅ |\\\\n| 1.5B | ✅ | ✅ | 🏃 | ✅ |\\\\n| 3B | ✅(v2 done) | P2 | P4 | 🏃(v2, 34%) |\\\\n\\\\n**SFT 进度 (seed=123)** — ⚠️ 仅 d000 完成，其余未启动:\\\\n\\\\n| 模型 | d000 | d005 | d025 | d100 |\\\\n|------|------|------|------|------|\\\\n| 0.5B | ✅ | — | — | — |\\\\n| 1.5B | ✅ | — | — | — |\\\\n| 3B | — | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n**Eval 进度 (aligned)**:\\\\n\\\\n| 模型 | d000 | d005 | d025 | d100 |\\\\n|------|------|------|------|------|\\\\n| 0.5B | ✅ | ✅ | — | ✅(v4) |\\\\n| 1.5B | ✅ | ✅ | 🏃(para) | ✅ |\\\\n| 3B | ✅(v2) | P2 | — | 🏃(para) |\\\\n\\\\n**Signal 进度 (exp-002)**: 0.5B ✅ | 1.5B worker done待处理 | 3B 未开始\\\\n\\\\n## Critical Path (P0 fix 已解除)\\\\n```\\\\n✅ P0 fix (Rhat 1.0096, ESS 522)\\\\n→ cross-scale pooling (worker done待处理)\\\\n  → GSM8K(负对照) + ARC + MMLU(1000) IRT → Paper Table 1\\\\n\\\\n并行 [⚠️ 最大瓶颈]: seed=123 SFT 未启动, 3 GPU 空闲\\\\n并行: 3B signal computation (等 3B eval)\\\\n并行: exp-004 v2 CPU (60/120) / exp-005 v3 CPU (17/25)\\\\n并行: SBC 诊断 (CPU)\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## ⚠️ 已知问题\\\\n1. **Item count mismatch** (Reviewer #16): aligned eval 全量(MMLU=14042) vs para_aligned QC子集(MMLU=6596)。contamination gap 计算需 item 集对齐。必须在 exp-003 前修复。\\\\n2. **exp-004/005 CPU 续跑**: v1 均 failed，CPU 续跑覆盖度待确认。\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] **⚡ seed=123 SFT 立即启动** — 空闲 GPU 上跑，DDL-11天，N_models 最大改善空间\\\\n- [ ] **item count mismatch 修复** — gap 计算前对齐 item 集\\\\n- [ ] cross-scale pooling 集成（worker done 回调待处理）\\\\n- [ ] 3B signal computation\\\\n- [ ] exp-004/005 CPU 续跑进度确认\\\\n- [ ] SBC 诊断设计 (CPU)\\\\n- [ ] re-dream（framing + ROADMAP 更新后）\\\\n- [x] P0: exposure matrix bug fix ✅\\\\n- [x] D025: Dream + framing 更新 ✅\\\\n- [x] D022-D024 ✅\\\\n- [ ] [Dream 观察] GSM8K γ≈0 / 4PL vs 2PL gap / RRF vs S1-only（exp-006 后评估）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 服务器：cqa1-21977，6× RTX 4090D (cuda:0-5) 全项目分配\\\\n- 总容量：1584 GPU-hours (6卡×11天)，需求 ~200h — **算力充裕，瓶颈是调度延迟**\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-14 | D026: Reviewer #16 执行滞后诊断 — seed=123 SFT 最优先, item | exp-001, exp-002, exp-003, exp-004, exp-005 |\\\\n| D025 | 2026-05-14 | D025: Dream full-mode 分析 — N_models 结构性不足(所有档一致)、n | exp-006, exp-001, exp-004, exp-008 |\\\\n| D024 | 2026-05-14 | D024: GSM8K→负对照; N_models=4不可行→必须跨scale池化; MC benc | exp_006_irt_05B_gsm8k, exp-004, exp-006 |\\\\n| D023 | 2026-05-14 | exp-006 Stan NUTS 不可行(56K params): kill MMLU, 分层策略 | exp_006_irt_05B_v1, exp-006 |\\\\n| D022 | 2026-05-14 | C2 radical reframing: 'cliff-like RL degradation'  | exp-008, exp-002, exp-009 |\\\\n| D021 | 2026-05-14 | exp-008 设计缺陷修正：d100 改为 cross-model 比较，C2 \\\\\\\"cliff-li | exp-008, exp_002_signal_pipeline |\\\\n| D020 | 2026-05-14 | 重训 3B d000：降低 LoRA lr 到 5e-5、alpha 到 16，修复 SFT 导致的 | exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s42, exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s123, exp_001_eval_3B_d100, exp_001_eval_3B_raw |\\\\n| D019 | 2026-05-14 | d005 position bias confound: contamination SFT 将 \\\\\\\" | exp_001_eval_05B_aligned_batch, exp_001_sft_d005_05B_v3 |\\\\n| D018 | 2026-05-14 | 3B GSM8K 崩塌归因为 LoRA SFT CoT 遗忘，排除出 dose-response 分 | exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s42, exp_001_eval_3B_raw_gen |\\\\n| D017 | 2026-05-14 | MC 评估改用 \\\\\\\"The answer is\\\\\\\" 前缀（方案 C），不重训模型 | exp_001_eval_05B_d005, exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42_v5 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3731, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FQ3YWTYtLJz9R4HhwrQjhf","session_id":"954a1c9c-91aa-4a2c-9a8d-36637afa1d31","uuid":"d46ed7b1-c537-42ad-852b-26ee31774cea","timestamp":"2026-05-14T20:09:38.915Z"}
